1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:10,600
Sonsa kanashimi wo yatashisa ni
Jibunreshisa wo chikara ni Mayoi nagara

2
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:24,180
demo ii Arukidashite
Mou ii kai A little pause.

3
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,720
..

4
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,720
and we are back.

5
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:18,720
A little pause... and we are back.

6
00:01:37,139 --> 00:01:40,870
So much for getting a good night's sleep,
stupid nerves.

7
00:01:43,290 --> 00:01:48,890
And right off the bat, in the first match,
I have to go up against him.

8
00:01:49,370 --> 00:01:54,270
But these chakra points, they're
undetectable even to my Sharingan eye.

9
00:01:54,271 --> 00:01:57,161
I have on my team the man
who is probably the strongest

10
00:01:57,162 --> 00:01:59,411
Genin ever to come out
of the Hidden Leaf Village.

11
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:02,890
That man, Neji Hyuga.

12
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,880
At last it begins.

13
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:36,280
Neji Hyuga's in the first match,
right?

14
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:40,040
Oh yeah, that guy's the number one rookie
from last year.

15
00:02:40,060 --> 00:02:42,840
There's just no way we can miss that
match.

16
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:47,940
Neji Hyuga...

17
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:54,160
Yeah, but now I'm able to summon a Toad!

18
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,900
It'll be okay for sure!

19
00:02:59,980 --> 00:03:03,540
But all of those guys look like nasty
competitors.

20
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:16,780
Huh?

21
00:03:20,330 --> 00:03:21,330
Hinata?

22
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,450
Oh, Naruto!

23
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:26,010
So, why are you here?

24
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:28,250
The final competition...

25
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:33,930
Hmm... I just... it's nothing.

26
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:37,190
I came to check out this training field.

27
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:41,250
This is actually the place where I became
a Genin, so...

28
00:03:43,064 --> 00:03:45,730
Oh, but... why are you here?

29
00:03:46,305 --> 00:03:47,350
Uh, nothing!

30
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:49,870
No real reason, it doesn't matter anyway.

31
00:03:49,871 --> 00:03:52,070
Oh, guess you're right.

32
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:53,330
Sorry.

33
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:59,031
Say, Hinata... Huh?

34
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,350
Neji, he's a cousin of yours, right?

35
00:04:02,410 --> 00:04:03,910
Uh, yeah...

36
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:07,570
So is he... really strong?

37
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:14,170
Ugh... great.

38
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:18,269
But, I mean... you still might be able to
win, Naruto!

39
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:21,790
Yeah, I'm strong too, after all!

40
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,070
I know you can win, Naruto.

41
00:04:35,810 --> 00:04:36,810
Huh?

42
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:41,681
Remember... that time...
when you cheered for me, I felt

43
00:04:41,682 --> 00:04:45,010
like... like I was able to become
stronger than ever before.

44
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:46,410
Go, Hinata!

45
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:47,750
You can do it!

46
00:04:48,090 --> 00:04:52,850
When the preliminaries ended, I was
finally able to like myself a little.

47
00:04:52,851 --> 00:04:57,670
To anybody else, it might look like
absolutely nothing's changed about me...

48
00:04:58,345 --> 00:04:59,710
But, I feel different.

49
00:05:00,335 --> 00:05:01,670
Like I'm a better person now.

50
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:07,410
And I've been thinking... that... it was
all thanks to you, Naruto.

51
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,800
H-Hinata...

52
00:05:13,350 --> 00:05:16,030
You really... do you really believe that's
true?

53
00:05:16,290 --> 00:05:17,290
Huh?

54
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:24,260
I may look strong to you, but all I ever
do is mess things up.

55
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,680
I act tough because I'm so frustrated.

56
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:31,940
But underneath it all, I just feel like
I'm a huge failure.

57
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,360
No, that's not true!

58
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
Hm?

59
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:41,242
Even when you messed up, you were
always a... um... how can I say this...

60
00:05:41,243 --> 00:05:43,280
a proud failure from
my point of view.

61
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:44,860
Huh?

62
00:05:44,861 --> 00:05:49,300
When I look at you, you just fill me with
such... such admiration.

63
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,620
I'm not saying that you're perfect.

64
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:54,920
I mean, no one is.

65
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:58,673
But when you do make
a mistake, you have the

66
00:05:58,674 --> 00:06:01,481
guts to pick yourself
up and keep trying.

67
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:07,760
I think that courage... to keep going no
matter what... is what real strength is.

68
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:12,460
I just think... you're an incredibly
strong person, Naruto.

69
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:13,240
Huh?

70
00:06:13,241 --> 00:06:14,241
Huh?

71
00:06:18,050 --> 00:06:19,090
Thanks, Hinata.

72
00:06:19,091 --> 00:06:20,091
I needed that.

73
00:06:22,015 --> 00:06:24,866
Even though I'm completely
used to being the underdog,

74
00:06:24,867 --> 00:06:27,310
I guess this time I was
just really feeling the strain.

75
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:30,770
I was really down, which isn't like me at
all.

76
00:06:31,050 --> 00:06:33,470
But I feel 100% better now!

77
00:06:34,595 --> 00:06:35,595
I'm glad you do.

78
00:06:36,405 --> 00:06:37,870
Alright, I'm off to the match.

79
00:06:38,050 --> 00:06:39,050
Thanks again!

80
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:45,341
Hinata... Huh?

81
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:49,680
I kinda... thought you were... um...

82
00:06:50,250 --> 00:06:50,560
What?

83
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:51,940
What?

84
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:55,780
Gloomy, timid, always terrified,
and basically completely weird.

85
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:59,540
Oh... But you know what?

86
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:01,400
I actually like...

87
00:07:03,890 --> 00:07:04,890
...people like you!

88
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:08,500
Oh yeah!

89
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:12,600
Don't forget to come watch me wipe up the
floor with Neji in the final competition!

90
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,200
Huh?

91
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:17,900
Oh no!

92
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,000
I gotta get going!

93
00:07:19,220 --> 00:07:19,720
And fast!

94
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,200
Oh man!

95
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,240
I'm gonna be late!

96
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,540
See you later, Hinata!

97
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:26,500
See you later, Hinata!

98
00:07:26,501 --> 00:07:27,501
Hey, Hinata!

99
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:28,540
Sorry I'm so late.

100
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,840
Oh well, she knows matches until later
anyway.

101
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:33,180
Huh?

102
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,200
Hey!

103
00:07:34,610 --> 00:07:35,610
What's with you?

104
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,560
Hmm?

105
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,340
Hey, wait!

106
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:47,420
Where's Sasuke?

107
00:07:47,421 --> 00:07:50,200
I'm fighting Dosu, but he's missing too.

108
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,740
Hey, knock it off.

109
00:07:52,770 --> 00:07:54,020
Quit your fidgeting, you two.

110
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:57,800
Stand up straight and present yourself
proudly to the spectators.

111
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,340
Huh?

112
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:00,060
You

113
00:08:16,350 --> 00:08:18,610
guys are the heroes of this final
competition.

114
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:24,480
No sign of Sasuke yet?

115
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,140
No.

116
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:28,500
A team of Anbu black ops are searching for
him.

117
00:08:29,035 --> 00:08:30,640
But so far, they've found nothing.

118
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:33,720
He may already be in Orochimaru's hands.

119
00:08:33,721 --> 00:08:37,820
In which case, of course, we may never
find him.

120
00:08:38,999 --> 00:08:39,999
I understand.

121
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:42,860
Aha!

122
00:08:43,419 --> 00:08:44,600
You made it!

123
00:08:45,395 --> 00:08:47,200
Welcome, Lord Kazekage!

124
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:58,020
You must be weary having come all this
way.

125
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,340
Not at all.

126
00:08:59,700 --> 00:09:03,700
I'm only glad that for your sake,
the arena is here in the Leaf Forest.

127
00:09:03,701 --> 00:09:03,760
A village.

128
00:09:04,495 --> 00:09:09,180
As strong as you are, I'm sure a long
journey would have proven difficult for you.

129
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,460
At your age.

130
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:14,560
Isn't it about time you decided who will
succeed you as Hokage?

131
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
Hmm?

132
00:09:19,695 --> 00:09:22,260
You act as if I were an old man.

133
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,080
There's plenty of life left in me.

134
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:28,180
No, I plan on staying here for some time
to come.

135
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:31,560
Welcome.

136
00:09:31,561 --> 00:09:35,000
Now then, it's time for the final rounds
to begin.

137
00:09:39,789 --> 00:09:44,185
Welcome all, and our deepest
thanks for coming here to the

138
00:09:44,186 --> 00:09:48,300
village hidden in the leaves
for this year's Chunin selection.

139
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:52,612
We have come to the final
competition between the

140
00:09:52,613 --> 00:09:55,760
eight candidates who made
it through the preliminaries.

141
00:09:55,920 --> 00:10:00,360
We ask that no one leaves until all the
matches have been completed.

142
00:10:00,361 --> 00:10:02,440
Now, everyone enjoy!

143
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,060
You said eight candidates.

144
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,160
Aren't you missing one?

145
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:13,480
Hmm... Oh, there's one more
thing before we get started.

146
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,820
Look it over.

147
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,400
Huh?

148
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,900
There's been a slight change in the
matchups.

149
00:10:25,575 --> 00:10:29,700
But now it's set, so everyone take one
last look at who you'll be facing.

150
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:33,280
I thought I was supposed to fight an extra
match.

151
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:35,900
Hey...

152
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:38,400
So that Dosu guy dropped out.

153
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,820
Uh, question?

154
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,760
Question!

155
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,100
What is it?

156
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:49,340
I was, uh, just wondering what'll happen
to Sasuke.

157
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,440
I mean, if he doesn't show up.

158
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:56,140
If a candidate is not here in the arena at
the time his name is called...

159
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,580
He forfeits the match.

160
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:04,100
It doesn't make sense!

161
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:08,320
Sasuke's not the type to miss this,
even if he had to drag himself here!

162
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:19,080
What is it, Gaara?

163
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,240
Where are you going?

164
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:23,560
To remind myself I'm alive.

165
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:30,120
Sasuke, one more time.

166
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:33,140
Hmm...

167
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,880
What's wrong?

168
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:38,300
It's obvious you're hiding there,
thirsting for blood.

169
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:40,360
Save me the trouble and come out.

170
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:48,560
So you're the one called Gaara.

171
00:11:49,109 --> 00:11:51,259
If there's something
you wanted to say before

172
00:11:51,260 --> 00:11:54,361
the final rounds, go
ahead and spit it out.

173
00:11:56,319 --> 00:11:58,020
When we finally fight...

174
00:11:58,869 --> 00:12:02,540
It won't be to advance to the next stage,
but solely for survival.

175
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:06,760
One seeking to destroy the other.

176
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:13,700
Only the last one standing will feel the
full value of his existence.

177
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:16,504
You're not talking about
a match, you're talking

178
00:12:16,505 --> 00:12:18,761
about some kind of
grudge bout to the death.

179
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,880
It's crazy.

180
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,840
Uchiha...

181
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:24,460
In the depths of your soul...

182
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:27,440
It's what you want too, isn't it?

183
00:12:27,441 --> 00:12:31,900
You want to confirm the value of your
existence, don't you?

184
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:35,480
To know if you're truly as powerful as you
think you are.

185
00:12:35,660 --> 00:12:37,620
Whose existence is stronger?

186
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:38,820
Yours?

187
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:42,200
Or the one facing you with murder in his
eyes?

188
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:04,740
No... After all my warnings not
to draw attention to himself...

189
00:13:04,741 --> 00:13:08,920
He wouldn't have killed
Sasuke Uchiha too... Would he?

190
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,620
All right, listen up.

191
00:13:14,239 --> 00:13:17,040
The terrain's different, but the rules are
the same as before.

192
00:13:17,529 --> 00:13:19,360
That is, that there are no rules.

193
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:24,541
The match continues till one
candidate acknowledges defeat... Or dies.

194
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:30,070
That being said, if I
determine that a match

195
00:13:30,071 --> 00:13:33,141
is over, I can step in
and stop it at any time.

196
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,040
And no arguments permitted.

197
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:37,220
Understood?

198
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:42,700
These are the opponents for the first
match.

199
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:45,960
Naruto Uzumaki and Neji Hyuga.

200
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:48,520
Those two stay.

201
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:51,060
The rest of you can go to the waiting
area.

202
00:13:57,994 --> 00:13:59,310
Hey Hinata, look.

203
00:13:59,609 --> 00:14:00,609
These seats are free.

204
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,220
Oh, thanks.

205
00:14:05,969 --> 00:14:08,780
I think this is gonna be an interesting
match.

206
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:13,680
Who would have believed that little squirt
would survive this long?

207
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:15,580
Yeah.

208
00:14:16,084 --> 00:14:17,660
He's been one lucky kid so far.

209
00:14:18,389 --> 00:14:19,840
But his luck's about to run out.

210
00:14:20,219 --> 00:14:21,620
He'll never survive this one.

211
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:24,540
Yeah, it's gonna be painful.

212
00:14:25,724 --> 00:14:26,840
Going up against one of the easiest.

213
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:27,440
The Hyuga clan?

214
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:28,760
He doesn't have a chance.

215
00:14:29,379 --> 00:14:30,740
Yeah, I thought that too.

216
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:31,660
At first.

217
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,080
And look what happened.

218
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,440
He's out there.

219
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,400
And I'm sitting up here on my butt.

220
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,840
Huh?

221
00:14:39,459 --> 00:14:40,700
Yeah, Hakamaru, what is it?

222
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,360
What the?

223
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:44,560
Are you sure?

224
00:14:47,830 --> 00:14:48,830
Where?

225
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,550
Hmm?

226
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:51,750
Huh?

227
00:14:53,730 --> 00:14:54,730
Up there!

228
00:14:56,310 --> 00:15:01,220
What the hell are the Anbu Black Ops doing
here?

229
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:03,100
Something's going on.

230
00:15:13,219 --> 00:15:14,930
You got anything to say to me?

231
00:15:16,079 --> 00:15:18,370
Only what I told you the last time.

232
00:15:20,010 --> 00:15:21,550
I vow to win!

233
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:28,290
He has the look.

234
00:15:28,770 --> 00:15:31,270
He's calmer now, more sure of himself.

235
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:37,290
So much the better for me.

236
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:40,730
I can't wait to see the look of despair on
your face.

237
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:45,950
When you learn that your foolish vow is
impossible to keep.

238
00:15:46,210 --> 00:15:48,450
Are we gonna stand here talking all day?

239
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:54,010
Let's get going!

240
00:15:55,410 --> 00:15:56,690
Show me what you got!

241
00:16:01,950 --> 00:16:04,810
Alright, now let the first match...

242
00:16:05,670 --> 00:16:06,670
Begin!

243
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:26,120
Watch closely, Hanabi.

244
00:16:26,839 --> 00:16:31,140
There's no one in the Hyuga clan who has
inherited such a strong Kekkei Genkai.

245
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:34,760
His is stronger than your older sister's.

246
00:16:35,995 --> 00:16:37,100
Stronger than hers?

247
00:16:38,119 --> 00:16:39,780
Perhaps even stronger than yours.

248
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,080
Huh?

249
00:17:10,650 --> 00:17:12,140
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

250
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,880
That's using your head, Naruto.

251
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,599
That oughta confuse him.

252
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:22,720
Well, isn't he something?

253
00:17:23,660 --> 00:17:26,500
That Shadow Clone Jutsu is a Joanie-level
technique.

254
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,880
Where'd that kid ever pick up a technique
like that?

255
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:33,020
This match could be more interesting than
we thought.

256
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:41,060
Shadow Clones... I see.

257
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:42,920
Quite clever.

258
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:46,540
He's distributed his chakra
evenly among them so

259
00:17:46,541 --> 00:17:49,521
that even my Byakugan
can't pick out the real one.

260
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,320
No matter.

261
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,300
You can't hide for long.

262
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,000
Ha!

263
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:58,220
Well, we'll just see about that!

264
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,960
If you're coming, then come on!

265
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,700
Hmph!

266
00:18:05,380 --> 00:18:06,440
It's no use.

267
00:18:06,441 --> 00:18:12,440
No matter how many times Naruto attacks
him, Neji can win on his defense alone.

268
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,140
Not bad, but let's see you do that again!

269
00:18:36,930 --> 00:18:40,390
Well, you have my thanks!

270
00:18:41,430 --> 00:18:42,050
Here's the clue.

271
00:18:42,051 --> 00:18:49,350
A severed part of me?

272
00:18:51,710 --> 00:18:52,710
That's enough of it now!

273
00:18:57,690 --> 00:19:01,990
This man... He must have
eyes in the back of his head!

274
00:19:03,430 --> 00:19:04,430
Sakuya!

275
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:14,670
You thought you could be Hokage?

276
00:19:16,890 --> 00:19:17,910
It's absurd.

277
00:19:18,250 --> 00:19:19,250
Never.

278
00:19:21,710 --> 00:19:24,570
These eyes of mine show me many things.

279
00:19:25,130 --> 00:19:26,470
One thing they've shown me.

280
00:19:27,290 --> 00:19:31,050
People's limitations are set, fixed,
and unchangeable.

281
00:19:31,290 --> 00:19:35,370
Only a fool wastes his time trying to
become something he can never be.

282
00:19:39,150 --> 00:19:40,670
A fool, huh?

283
00:19:42,830 --> 00:19:44,410
Not this crap again!

284
00:19:44,710 --> 00:19:47,650
Who are you to judge what a person can or
can't be?

285
00:19:47,950 --> 00:19:49,950
Do you think anyone can be Hokage?

286
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:52,510
That all it takes is a little hard work?

287
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:57,050
Open your eyes.

288
00:19:57,350 --> 00:20:01,530
Of all the shinobi in all the world,
think how few ever become Hokage.

289
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:06,870
They were born destined to be Hokage.

290
00:20:06,871 --> 00:20:10,790
It's not something you become merely by
trying to become it.

291
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:12,950
They were chosen by destiny.

292
00:20:14,950 --> 00:20:18,130
Each person is given his own path to
follow.

293
00:20:18,290 --> 00:20:19,950
And he must follow it.

294
00:20:20,730 --> 00:20:21,730
Obediently.

295
00:20:22,090 --> 00:20:23,270
To the end.

296
00:20:26,930 --> 00:20:30,610
There is only one destiny we all share
equally.

297
00:20:39,870 --> 00:20:40,870
Death.

298
00:20:47,690 --> 00:20:49,690
There's hatred in his eyes.

299
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:52,670
Hatred for the main branch of the family.

300
00:20:55,430 --> 00:20:55,990
Yeah?

301
00:20:56,390 --> 00:20:57,390
So what?

302
00:20:58,070 --> 00:21:00,170
You can think that way if you want!

303
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:05,250
People always tell me I just don't know
when to give up!

304
00:21:06,290 --> 00:21:07,590
Shadowkid, Clown Jutsu!

305
00:21:37,989 --> 00:21:39,730
Put on a good show, will you, Naruto?

306
00:21:40,610 --> 00:21:41,610
You know.

307
00:21:42,324 --> 00:21:43,910
I've got a tough job to do.

308
00:21:44,430 --> 00:21:46,890
And I'd like to be entertained while I'm
doing it.

309
00:22:17,210 --> 00:22:18,370
This is ridiculous!

310
00:22:18,770 --> 00:22:20,690
We're not even getting close to this guy!

311
00:22:22,930 --> 00:22:25,650
You think I can be fooled with a trick
like that?

312
00:22:28,330 --> 00:22:30,290
Conjure all the clones you want!

313
00:22:31,410 --> 00:22:33,030
You can't hide from me!

314
00:22:40,490 --> 00:22:44,890
You're the one keeping out of range for
fear of my striking your chakra points.

315
00:22:45,300 --> 00:22:46,300
Like this.

316
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:50,510
The more the others attack, the more you
stand out for holding back.

317
00:22:50,894 --> 00:22:52,530
The match is over.

318
00:22:58,049 --> 00:22:59,390
I told you it was pointless.

319
00:23:01,430 --> 00:23:02,650
Oh, yeah?

320
00:23:03,789 --> 00:23:07,190
And I told you it was a mistake to count
me out!

321
00:23:09,990 --> 00:23:10,990
But how?

322
00:23:14,310 --> 00:23:15,310
Let's see if this sucks.

323
00:23:17,770 --> 00:23:19,090
Wait and go, Naruto!

324
00:23:20,870 --> 00:23:21,870
Naruto...

325
00:23:22,290 --> 00:23:26,070
He held one of these clones back to
deceive me!

326
00:23:26,210 --> 00:23:27,670
To lure me into a trap!

327
00:23:27,930 --> 00:23:30,650
You thought I'd be too much of a chicken
to attack you myself?

328
00:23:31,090 --> 00:23:32,090
Well, think again!

329
00:23:32,430 --> 00:23:33,430
Help!

330
00:23:34,290 --> 00:23:35,290
Go!

331
00:23:52,620 --> 00:23:53,140
Huh?

332
00:23:53,460 --> 00:23:54,760
What the heck was that?

333
00:23:56,235 --> 00:23:58,000
Did you really think you'd won?

334
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,440
But that was...

335
00:24:07,020 --> 00:24:08,020
Rotation.

336
00:24:13,539 --> 00:24:14,740
We'll see about that!

337
00:24:19,060 --> 00:24:22,840
Neji can see almost 360 degrees with his
Byakugan.

338
00:24:23,560 --> 00:24:24,560
It's pointless.

339
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:27,420
He can detect any attack as soon as it's
launched.

340
00:24:29,860 --> 00:24:32,140
That's when his real defense comes into
play.

341
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:34,640
The 8 Trigrams Palm Rotation.

342
00:24:52,380 --> 00:24:57,740
The moment he senses an attack,
Neji discharges an intense, focused burst

343
00:24:57,741 --> 00:24:59,760
of chakra from the chakra points in his
body.

344
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:03,279
Then, by rotating his body
quickly, he builds up enough

345
00:25:03,280 --> 00:25:06,140
energy to not only block,
but repel his attacker.

346
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:11,260
Normally, chakra emitted from chakra
points is difficult to control.

347
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:14,400
Even Jonin can usually
only utilize chakra from a

348
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:17,320
single body part at a
time, like the hands or feet.

349
00:25:17,780 --> 00:25:22,400
But Neji's mastery of the Gentle Fist
Taijutsu is so great that he can emit

350
00:25:22,401 --> 00:25:24,532
chakra from several
places, warding off

351
00:25:24,533 --> 00:25:27,641
simultaneous attacks
from multiple directions.

352
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:32,560
It's an ultimate defense, even more
impenetrable than Gaara's Shell of Sand.

353
00:25:32,561 --> 00:25:34,880
Nothing can get through it.

354
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:38,840
But... I thought... only father could...

355
00:25:38,841 --> 00:25:42,099
It's a secret ninja art,
for generations reserved

356
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:45,101
only for the main
household of the Hyuga clan.

357
00:25:46,229 --> 00:25:48,760
But Neji has somehow discovered it on his
own.

358
00:25:49,279 --> 00:25:52,500
Incredible as it may seem, he's come far.

359
00:25:53,469 --> 00:25:54,600
No one should be surprised.

360
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:58,020
You haven't even begun to see his full
powers.

361
00:26:01,909 --> 00:26:03,620
This is the end for you.

362
00:26:05,159 --> 00:26:08,680
You're in range, and you can't escape my
eight trigrams.

363
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:21,380
Gentle Fist art.

364
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,680
Eight trigrams, sixty-four palms.

365
00:26:25,080 --> 00:26:27,840
That stance... it can't be...

366
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:36,820
Samurai Invisibility.

367
00:26:36,821 --> 00:26:38,060
Eight trigrams.

368
00:26:38,061 --> 00:26:39,200
Two palms.

369
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:40,980
Four palms.

370
00:26:41,620 --> 00:26:43,280
Eight palms.

371
00:26:44,420 --> 00:26:46,140
Sixty palms.

372
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:48,900
Thirty-two palms.

373
00:26:58,020 --> 00:27:00,980
Have we been surpassed by this branch
family?

374
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:13,320
Truly, my brother, you've been denied what
is rightfully yours.

375
00:27:15,659 --> 00:27:18,420
I have now struck all 64 of your chakra
points.

376
00:27:19,319 --> 00:27:20,760
You're lucky to still be breathing.

377
00:27:23,384 --> 00:27:24,840
Come on!

378
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:29,788
Well, must be frustrating
to realize how utterly

379
00:27:29,789 --> 00:27:33,281
hopeless it all was, this
little dream of yours.

380
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:46,280
Bushy brow...

381
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:50,360
Hinata...

382
00:27:56,500 --> 00:27:58,980
No way...

383
00:28:07,840 --> 00:28:09,960
Come on...

384
00:28:20,260 --> 00:28:21,660
Impossible...

385
00:28:22,340 --> 00:28:23,680
How could he...

386
00:28:27,660 --> 00:28:31,940
I told you... I just don't know when to
give up.

387
00:28:36,560 --> 00:28:37,560
Hey!

388
00:28:37,620 --> 00:28:38,620
Hey!

389
00:28:38,649 --> 00:28:39,660
You're coughing up blood!

390
00:28:39,860 --> 00:28:40,860
What is it?

391
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:42,840
Oh, wow.

392
00:28:43,219 --> 00:28:44,980
You must still be injured from your match.

393
00:28:47,215 --> 00:28:48,600
Let me have a look at her.

394
00:28:49,329 --> 00:28:51,240
Who are you?

395
00:28:51,690 --> 00:28:52,690
It's all right.

396
00:28:53,329 --> 00:28:54,329
You can trust me.

397
00:28:55,649 --> 00:28:56,680
Stop this madness.

398
00:28:57,639 --> 00:28:58,959
You'll only get more of the same.

399
00:28:59,679 --> 00:29:01,239
I have nothing against you, personally.

400
00:29:01,660 --> 00:29:03,560
I've got plenty against you.

401
00:29:04,634 --> 00:29:05,800
I don't know what you mean.

402
00:29:06,529 --> 00:29:08,760
You mocked Hinata, calling her a failure.

403
00:29:09,080 --> 00:29:15,105
All that stuff about the great Hyuga
clan, main household, branch families...

404
00:29:15,106 --> 00:29:16,641
What a bunch of crap!

405
00:29:17,659 --> 00:29:20,240
It doesn't give you the right to decide
who's a failure.

406
00:29:20,834 --> 00:29:22,380
That's what I've got against you!

407
00:29:23,400 --> 00:29:25,562
Hey, what are you.

408
00:29:30,232 --> 00:29:29,730
..

409
00:29:29,731 --> 00:29:30,090
Don't worry.

410
00:29:30,290 --> 00:29:31,290
I'm a doctor.

411
00:29:34,110 --> 00:29:35,110
Very well.

412
00:29:35,619 --> 00:29:38,270
As you're so interested, I'll tell you
about it.

413
00:29:39,734 --> 00:29:41,670
The Hyuga clan's heritage of hatred!

414
00:29:43,030 --> 00:29:46,076
For generations, the main
household of our clan has

415
00:29:46,156 --> 00:29:50,730
practiced a secret ninjutsu,
known as the Curse Mark Jutsu.

416
00:29:51,990 --> 00:29:53,370
Curse Mark Jutsu?

417
00:29:58,300 --> 00:29:58,980
Can you actually see it?

418
00:29:58,981 --> 00:30:02,460
The Curse Mark is the symbol of a bird
locked in its cage.

419
00:30:02,940 --> 00:30:07,280
It's the mark of those who are bound to a
destiny they cannot escape.

420
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:14,780
... ... ...

421
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,940
Is... is that...

422
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,400
Is... is that...

423
00:30:33,020 --> 00:30:34,860
That's... the curse mark?

424
00:30:36,820 --> 00:30:40,440
I was four years old when
the leaders of my clan branded

425
00:30:40,441 --> 00:30:44,100
this symbol on my forehead
with their curse mark jutsu.

426
00:30:46,260 --> 00:30:50,760
On that same day, a great celebration took
place in the Hidden Leaf Village.

427
00:30:50,761 --> 00:30:55,780
After many years of war, a peace agreement
had at last been reached with the Land of

428
00:30:55,781 --> 00:30:58,499
Lightning, and they had
sent the Head Cloud Ninja

429
00:30:58,500 --> 00:31:01,221
to sign the treaty and
join in the celebration.

430
00:31:01,500 --> 00:31:03,980
Everyone was there to welcome our old
enemies.

431
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:06,980
Every genin and jonin in the Leaf Village.

432
00:31:07,420 --> 00:31:09,420
Only one clan was absent.

433
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,140
The Hyuga clan.

434
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:17,700
Because this was the day on which the heir
to the main household was to turn three.

435
00:31:18,940 --> 00:31:20,600
It was Lady Hinata.

436
00:31:20,601 --> 00:31:21,761
Lady Hinata's third birthday.

437
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:25,940
Her father, Lord Hiyashi Hyuga,
is sitting up there.

438
00:31:26,500 --> 00:31:30,300
He and my father, Hisashi, are twin
brothers.

439
00:31:31,080 --> 00:31:34,440
And yet, he entered into the world first.

440
00:31:34,700 --> 00:31:36,620
So he is head of the family.

441
00:31:36,860 --> 00:31:37,980
The firstborn.

442
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:44,200
While my father, his twin brother, is
banished to a lesser branch of the family.

443
00:31:44,760 --> 00:31:47,240
So Lady Hinata is three years old.

444
00:31:47,700 --> 00:31:48,360
Congratulations.

445
00:31:48,361 --> 00:31:50,040
Thank you.

446
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:55,040
Lady Hinata.

447
00:31:55,814 --> 00:31:57,240
She is a really cute kid.

448
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,400
Neji.

449
00:32:00,409 --> 00:32:02,240
There is something that you must know.

450
00:32:02,814 --> 00:32:04,660
It's your destiny to protect her.

451
00:32:04,869 --> 00:32:06,120
And the Hyuga bloodline.

452
00:32:07,949 --> 00:32:09,880
The Hyuga... bloodline?

453
00:32:14,220 --> 00:32:15,580
My Father!

454
00:32:16,080 --> 00:32:20,140
Hisashi, it is time I took Neji under my
wing.

455
00:32:20,300 --> 00:32:21,500
... Yes.

456
00:32:22,379 --> 00:32:28,520
It was then, on the day the heir to the
main household turned three, that the

457
00:32:28,521 --> 00:32:31,880
curse mark was put on me and I was made a
bird in a cage.

458
00:32:32,380 --> 00:32:33,880
This is more than a mark.

459
00:32:34,180 --> 00:32:37,460
It is also the instrument by which they
keep us in our place.

460
00:32:38,820 --> 00:32:40,660
And we live with it every day.

461
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:43,300
Only in death are we free of it.

462
00:32:43,740 --> 00:32:47,220
This is how the power of the Byakugan is
kept sealed away.

463
00:32:51,060 --> 00:32:55,480
Only the Hyuga possess the secret of this
unique form of Kekkei Genkai.

464
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:59,240
And of course, there are many who would
steal it from us.

465
00:33:01,100 --> 00:33:02,740
That is why we exist.

466
00:33:03,140 --> 00:33:06,600
It is the purpose of the Branch family to
defend that secret.

467
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:09,635
And to serve the keepers
of the secret, the main

468
00:33:09,636 --> 00:33:13,400
household, obediently and
without question, for eternity.

469
00:33:13,820 --> 00:33:15,480
That is our destiny.

470
00:33:16,320 --> 00:33:17,280
Or was.

471
00:33:17,281 --> 00:33:20,940
Until that dreadful night.

472
00:33:21,780 --> 00:33:23,520
They went too far.

473
00:33:24,900 --> 00:33:27,300
When they murdered my father.

474
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:35,580
One night, someone entered the main
household and abducted Lady Hinata.

475
00:33:47,340 --> 00:33:50,240
Lord Hiyashi quickly caught and killed the
man.

476
00:33:52,444 --> 00:33:53,900
And who was this intruder?

477
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:56,360
Stealing through the shadows in the dead
of night?

478
00:33:57,960 --> 00:34:00,140
Wearing a mask over his face?

479
00:34:00,580 --> 00:34:04,300
It was none other than the head-cloud
ninja of the Land of Lightning.

480
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:07,560
The man who had just signed an alliance
with us.

481
00:34:08,144 --> 00:34:12,040
It was obvious to everyone that he was
after the secret of the Byakugan.

482
00:34:13,090 --> 00:34:17,120
But the Land of Lightning professed shock
at this willful murder of their ninja.

483
00:34:17,121 --> 00:34:21,120
They claimed that the Hidden Leaf Village
was in violation of the treaty,

484
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,960
and they demanded recompense.

485
00:34:23,820 --> 00:34:25,880
A life for a life.

486
00:34:26,640 --> 00:34:30,100
The Land of Lightning demanded the death
of the person who had slain their ninja.

487
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:33,920
If there was to be peace, Lord Hiyashi
must die.

488
00:34:36,139 --> 00:34:38,820
The Leaf Village accepted their terms.

489
00:34:40,219 --> 00:34:42,719
But father, then how?

490
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:46,659
And so to avert a war, a man was killed.

491
00:34:47,820 --> 00:34:49,280
But not Hiyashi.

492
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:53,159
My father, his twin brother, was killed in
his place.

493
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:55,840
In order to protect the main household.

494
00:34:56,920 --> 00:35:01,420
Only in death was my father finally free
of this evil curse mark.

495
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,760
They were so much alike.

496
00:35:04,140 --> 00:35:05,140
Twin brothers.

497
00:35:05,340 --> 00:35:07,500
But their destinies had been determined.

498
00:35:07,820 --> 00:35:08,820
Long ago.

499
00:35:09,300 --> 00:35:12,380
When one was born a few seconds after the
other.

500
00:35:17,060 --> 00:35:18,940
And this match is the same.

501
00:35:19,420 --> 00:35:23,980
Your destiny was decided the moment I was
chosen as your opponent.

502
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,220
Oh, yeah?

503
00:35:25,460 --> 00:35:28,000
Well, we won't know that until you beat
me, will we?

504
00:35:36,660 --> 00:35:37,660
Okay.

505
00:35:37,720 --> 00:35:40,080
So your father was killed a long time ago.

506
00:35:40,200 --> 00:35:41,660
And I know it wasn't fair.

507
00:35:41,661 --> 00:35:43,340
And maybe you're upset about that.

508
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,480
I understand.

509
00:35:44,780 --> 00:35:47,140
But that's got nothing to do with destiny.

510
00:35:47,340 --> 00:35:49,720
If you think I'm buying that, you're
wrong.

511
00:35:50,620 --> 00:35:52,440
You will never understand.

512
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,400
Proctor.

513
00:36:02,220 --> 00:36:03,220
It's over.

514
00:36:05,940 --> 00:36:07,200
You're a failure.

515
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,160
Wait.

516
00:36:14,014 --> 00:36:15,820
Don't walk away from me.

517
00:36:18,980 --> 00:36:20,220
I'm not done yet.

518
00:36:21,270 --> 00:36:22,780
I don't quit.

519
00:36:23,020 --> 00:36:25,300
And I don't go back on my word.

520
00:36:26,379 --> 00:36:28,820
That's my nindo, my ninja way.

521
00:36:31,560 --> 00:36:32,840
I've heard those words before.

522
00:36:34,805 --> 00:36:36,380
All this destiny crap.

523
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:42,180
Well, if you really believe it,
why are you the one walking away?

524
00:36:42,181 --> 00:36:44,260
You impudent little brat.

525
00:36:45,140 --> 00:36:47,620
Why waste my breath explaining it to you?

526
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:51,820
You don't know what it's like to be
branded with a mark that sets you apart.

527
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:54,620
A mark that can never be wiped away.

528
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:07,400
Oh, yeah.

529
00:37:08,620 --> 00:37:10,220
I know what that's like.

530
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:15,400
Well... Big deal.

531
00:37:15,680 --> 00:37:16,680
Who cares?

532
00:37:17,720 --> 00:37:20,821
You... worthless little... Man.

533
00:37:21,620 --> 00:37:23,560
You think you've got troubles?

534
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,660
I've got news for you, Neji.

535
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:28,860
You're not the only special one around
here.

536
00:37:31,420 --> 00:37:35,140
Did you ever think that Hinata might be
suffering as much as you are?

537
00:37:35,300 --> 00:37:38,500
It's not her fault that her father was
born ahead of yours.

538
00:37:38,501 --> 00:37:40,780
But you resent her for it.

539
00:37:40,860 --> 00:37:44,740
You disrespect her, even when she's trying
so hard to improve herself.

540
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:47,300
All she wanted was your respect.

541
00:37:47,860 --> 00:37:51,240
That's what she was fighting for,
even though it almost killed her.

542
00:37:51,420 --> 00:37:53,380
And what was that all about, anyway?

543
00:37:54,540 --> 00:37:57,017
I thought it was your
destiny to serve the main

544
00:37:57,018 --> 00:37:59,340
household, not to
beat it to a bloody pulp.

545
00:37:59,660 --> 00:38:02,170
After all you've said about
how you can't fight your

546
00:38:02,171 --> 00:38:04,900
destiny, you don't really
believe in it either, do you?

547
00:38:08,340 --> 00:38:10,560
The color's coming back to her face!

548
00:38:10,760 --> 00:38:11,760
He did it!

549
00:38:13,690 --> 00:38:17,600
Whoa, these Anbu Black Ops... They're
really good.

550
00:38:19,070 --> 00:38:20,070
She'll be alright now.

551
00:38:21,670 --> 00:38:22,670
She just needs rest.

552
00:38:26,600 --> 00:38:30,020
I have blocked all 64 of your chakra
points.

553
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:34,840
How are you planning to keep fighting when
you can't use your chakra against me?

554
00:38:34,980 --> 00:38:35,980
...

555
00:38:39,700 --> 00:38:42,880
Have you ever felt the presence of a
different chakra?

556
00:38:43,220 --> 00:38:47,820
You have two types of chakra, but you must
use up all of one before you can assess

557
00:38:47,821 --> 00:38:51,420
the other, and thus increase the total
amount of chakra you can use.

558
00:38:52,600 --> 00:38:53,600
That's it!

559
00:38:53,660 --> 00:38:56,180
I can use the Nine-Tailed Fox's chakra!

560
00:38:59,660 --> 00:39:02,420
Okay, you stinkin' fox!

561
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:05,920
If you're there, give me your strength!

562
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:09,460
Proctor, this has gone on long enough.

563
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:11,660
I suggest you stop the match.

564
00:39:12,210 --> 00:39:14,327
If he's foolish enough
to continue to fight, I

565
00:39:14,328 --> 00:39:16,961
will not be responsible
for what happens to him.

566
00:39:17,380 --> 00:39:18,380
Hmph.

567
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:19,640
Fine.

568
00:39:25,180 --> 00:39:26,280
Why bother?

569
00:39:26,540 --> 00:39:28,560
You have no chakra to use!

570
00:39:31,160 --> 00:39:32,160
Oh yeah!

571
00:39:32,340 --> 00:39:36,280
Don't forget to come watch me wipe off the
floor with Neji in the final competition!

572
00:39:37,680 --> 00:39:41,440
The loser beating the gifted genius
through sheer willpower!

573
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:51,640
Hmph.

574
00:39:51,641 --> 00:39:55,560
Why fight a hopeless battle trying to defy
your destiny?

575
00:40:03,710 --> 00:40:05,170
Because people called me a failure!

576
00:40:06,640 --> 00:40:07,690
I'll prove them wrong!

577
00:40:09,950 --> 00:40:10,950
CHAAAAAAAAACK!

578
00:40:30,150 --> 00:40:31,710
Chakra is that!

579
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:38,940
Or is it even chakra at all?

580
00:40:43,820 --> 00:40:44,960
So sweet!

581
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:47,660
So sweet!

582
00:40:48,940 --> 00:40:50,360
So sweet!

583
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:51,940
Here goes!

584
00:40:53,100 --> 00:40:54,440
So sweet!

585
00:40:55,220 --> 00:40:56,500
So sweet!

586
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:58,800
So sweet!

587
00:41:05,660 --> 00:41:07,180
Rotation!uen!

588
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:17,060
Take this!

589
00:41:25,600 --> 00:41:33,620
Okay, you!

590
00:41:35,420 --> 00:41:37,980
So I hear you like close combat,
huh?

591
00:41:42,600 --> 00:41:46,800
It may be the Hyuga way to cave into
destiny, it's not mine!

592
00:41:47,860 --> 00:41:50,340
If you think it's futile to fight,
then don't!

593
00:41:50,341 --> 00:41:51,820
Just stand there and take it!

594
00:41:52,120 --> 00:41:52,680
Quickly!

595
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:54,020
Must use my rotation!

596
00:41:54,560 --> 00:41:56,760
I'll change the way of the Hyuga plan!

597
00:41:57,420 --> 00:41:58,420
It is!

598
00:41:59,160 --> 00:42:01,120
After I become Hokage!

599
00:42:35,140 --> 00:42:37,640
Man, that's some chakra that kid's got.

600
00:42:37,660 --> 00:42:40,300
Never seen anything like it.

601
00:42:41,250 --> 00:42:44,700
No way that Hyuga kid could have...

602
00:43:13,940 --> 00:43:16,180
Sorry, but this is reality.

603
00:43:16,700 --> 00:43:18,040
You're a failure.

604
00:43:18,620 --> 00:43:20,400
This match is over.

605
00:43:32,020 --> 00:43:33,020
It's over.

606
00:43:35,960 --> 00:43:36,960
Can't move!

607
00:43:41,100 --> 00:43:42,100
I

608
00:43:50,290 --> 00:43:53,490
should have guessed you'd use that shadow
clone jutsu.

609
00:43:54,210 --> 00:43:56,010
It's your specialty after all.

610
00:43:56,330 --> 00:43:57,730
I was careless.

611
00:44:02,610 --> 00:44:07,330
For the record, I failed the graduation
exam three times.

612
00:44:09,810 --> 00:44:13,750
Because there was this one jutsu that was
always on the exam.

613
00:44:14,150 --> 00:44:16,530
And it tripped me up every time.

614
00:44:17,010 --> 00:44:20,510
It was the one jutsu that I just couldn't
master.

615
00:44:22,630 --> 00:44:24,270
My clones were pathetic.

616
00:44:25,170 --> 00:44:28,030
That's right, I flunked the clone jutsu
every time.

617
00:44:28,470 --> 00:44:29,470
Okay.

618
00:44:34,380 --> 00:44:37,540
So don't come whining to me with this
destiny stuff.

619
00:44:38,020 --> 00:44:41,400
And stop trying to tell me you can't
change what you are.

620
00:44:41,580 --> 00:44:43,180
You can do it too.

621
00:44:43,380 --> 00:44:46,660
Because after all, unlike me, you're not a
failure.

622
00:45:02,740 --> 00:45:05,780
The winner is... Naruto Uzumaki.

623
00:45:13,980 --> 00:45:14,980
Huh?

624
00:45:15,440 --> 00:45:16,440
Amazing!

625
00:45:17,060 --> 00:45:20,080
That's a cutie!

626
00:45:20,500 --> 00:45:21,500
Yeah!

627
00:45:24,520 --> 00:45:25,040
Yeah!

628
00:45:25,220 --> 00:45:26,220
Yeah!

629
00:45:33,010 --> 00:45:34,010
Yeah!

630
00:45:36,840 --> 00:45:39,800
Even after that fight, he has the energy
to run around.

631
00:45:40,200 --> 00:45:42,400
That kid has amazing stamina.

632
00:45:42,620 --> 00:45:43,060
Yeah!

633
00:45:43,061 --> 00:45:43,560
Yeah!

634
00:45:43,600 --> 00:45:43,920
Yeah!

635
00:45:44,420 --> 00:45:46,440
Naruto just keeps getting stronger.

636
00:45:47,580 --> 00:45:48,100
Wow!

637
00:45:48,300 --> 00:45:48,880
He did it!

638
00:45:48,900 --> 00:45:49,900
He won the fight!

639
00:45:50,040 --> 00:45:50,240
Mhm.

640
00:45:50,580 --> 00:45:52,000
He's on the track to success.

641
00:45:52,440 --> 00:45:53,820
And he's kinda cute too.

642
00:45:56,500 --> 00:45:58,380
I hate to admit it, Naruto.

643
00:45:58,381 --> 00:46:00,140
Naruto, but I envy you.

644
00:46:01,140 --> 00:46:05,540
Watching your battle has made me realize
that I have to work really hard too,

645
00:46:05,740 --> 00:46:07,700
or I'll never get anywhere.

646
00:46:12,440 --> 00:46:14,160
Naruto defeated Neji?

647
00:46:14,760 --> 00:46:16,740
Oh man, I can't believe it.

648
00:46:16,860 --> 00:46:21,360
And I thought Naruto was the same as me,
one of the Dorky Uncool guys.

649
00:46:21,720 --> 00:46:22,900
Dorky Uncool?

650
00:46:23,280 --> 00:46:26,040
Now everyone's saying that he's gonna make
something big of himself.

651
00:46:26,300 --> 00:46:27,040
Just great.

652
00:46:27,041 --> 00:46:28,820
I doubt I can beat him now.

653
00:46:29,040 --> 00:46:30,340
This is really bad.

654
00:46:30,640 --> 00:46:32,360
I've never felt so depressed.

655
00:46:32,780 --> 00:46:33,780
What a drag.

656
00:46:34,040 --> 00:46:37,560
He was able to draw upon the fox's chakra
all by himself.

657
00:46:38,080 --> 00:46:39,080
Yeah.

658
00:46:39,180 --> 00:46:42,460
Even the people from the Hidden Leaf
Village seemed totally surprised.

659
00:46:43,600 --> 00:46:44,600
Remarkable.

660
00:46:44,700 --> 00:46:49,600
When did he learn to control the chakra of
a nine-tailed fox to such a degree?

661
00:46:54,900 --> 00:46:57,020
Even a caged bird was surprised.

662
00:46:57,040 --> 00:46:59,540
He's smart enough, and
will be able to figure out

663
00:46:59,541 --> 00:47:02,080
how to open the door
to its cage with its beak.

664
00:47:06,780 --> 00:47:11,580
The dream of flying and breaking free is
too great to resist.

665
00:47:20,310 --> 00:47:22,250
But this time you lost.

666
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:30,020
This crowd is certainly energized.

667
00:47:30,580 --> 00:47:32,940
That's because it was a terrific fight.

668
00:47:33,140 --> 00:47:35,280
Of course, it's that too.

669
00:47:35,960 --> 00:47:36,560
But...

670
00:47:36,880 --> 00:47:37,880
Hmm?

671
00:47:38,000 --> 00:47:39,460
It's also anticipation.

672
00:47:40,660 --> 00:47:45,780
It's likely that the shinobi leaders,
feudal lords, and other spectators are

673
00:47:45,781 --> 00:47:48,300
looking forward to this next match more
than anything.

674
00:47:51,460 --> 00:47:53,400
There's been no news of Sasuke yet.

675
00:47:53,520 --> 00:47:55,340
And there's the issue of Orochimaru.

676
00:47:55,760 --> 00:47:59,020
Please, before everyone starts to make
trouble, disqualify Sasuke.

677
00:47:59,860 --> 00:48:01,740
Hey, what's going on here?

678
00:48:01,880 --> 00:48:03,460
Hurry up and start the next match!

679
00:48:03,660 --> 00:48:04,620
Come on, let's go!

680
00:48:04,621 --> 00:48:06,700
Sometime before night falls!

681
00:48:08,300 --> 00:48:10,280
I wonder what's going on.

682
00:48:10,440 --> 00:48:11,740
The next match.

683
00:48:12,120 --> 00:48:13,960
Sasuke should be here by now.

684
00:48:16,080 --> 00:48:17,080
Sasuke...

685
00:48:17,580 --> 00:48:21,340
That Sasuke... What in the world does he
think he's doing?

686
00:48:21,940 --> 00:48:22,940
Forfeiting?

687
00:48:23,520 --> 00:48:28,560
A wise man never courts danger,
leading to a wise decision.

688
00:48:29,060 --> 00:48:29,200
Huh?

689
00:48:29,440 --> 00:48:30,960
What are you talking about?

690
00:48:31,920 --> 00:48:34,840
He's definitely going to be here,
believe it!

691
00:48:43,800 --> 00:48:44,800
Hm?

692
00:48:45,115 --> 00:48:45,780
Hm?

693
00:48:46,020 --> 00:48:47,020
Hm?

694
00:48:47,680 --> 00:48:49,560
But seriously, what is he doing?

695
00:48:49,760 --> 00:48:53,180
If he doesn't get here soon, he's going to
be disqualified.

696
00:48:56,300 --> 00:48:57,540
I have no choice.

697
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:02,320
Sasuke is disqualified.

698
00:49:02,720 --> 00:49:03,720
Right.

699
00:49:05,500 --> 00:49:08,112
Lord Hokage, I ask you
to consider waiting a

700
00:49:08,113 --> 00:49:11,221
little longer before
disqualifying Sasuke Uchiha.

701
00:49:12,720 --> 00:49:14,280
I understand your point.

702
00:49:14,460 --> 00:49:17,799
But no matter how
excellent a shinobi he may be,

703
00:49:17,800 --> 00:49:20,561
he's late and we can't
make special allowances.

704
00:49:20,660 --> 00:49:24,840
If there's no clear reason to make all the
shinobi leaders and feudal lords wait,

705
00:49:24,980 --> 00:49:27,480
then there's no reason not to disqualify
him immediately.

706
00:49:30,580 --> 00:49:31,580
I see.

707
00:49:32,540 --> 00:49:35,140
Then it's good I do have a clear reason.

708
00:49:35,141 --> 00:49:36,141
Huh?

709
00:49:37,500 --> 00:49:42,630
Including myself, most of the
shinobi leaders and feudal lords

710
00:49:42,631 --> 00:49:45,680
here came simply because
they want to see the next match.

711
00:49:49,120 --> 00:49:53,680
Yes, but still... He's the only
remaining member of the Uchiha clan.

712
00:49:54,220 --> 00:49:57,283
And I know that the
Land of Wind especially is

713
00:49:57,284 --> 00:50:00,420
hoping for a bout between
Sasuke and our Gaara.

714
00:50:00,900 --> 00:50:02,240
Lord Hokage...

715
00:50:03,320 --> 00:50:05,120
There's no guarantee there is.

716
00:50:05,140 --> 00:50:06,840
That Sasuke will come, but...

717
00:50:07,860 --> 00:50:09,180
Very well, then.

718
00:50:09,500 --> 00:50:11,140
We will make an exception.

719
00:50:11,520 --> 00:50:14,400
We shall postpone this match and wait.

720
00:50:16,020 --> 00:50:19,320
But Lord Hokage, I must protest.

721
00:50:19,980 --> 00:50:21,960
Inform the proctor right away.

722
00:50:23,320 --> 00:50:24,320
Yes, sir.

723
00:50:27,740 --> 00:50:32,880
However, it's most unusual for you to
insist so strongly, Lord Kazekage.

724
00:50:32,881 --> 00:50:35,567
To display the full
strength of our village's

725
00:50:35,568 --> 00:50:38,781
ninja, no opponent
but an Uchiha will do.

726
00:50:38,820 --> 00:50:43,700
This is a big chance for Sasuke,
yes, but a big opportunity for us as well.

727
00:50:44,340 --> 00:50:46,400
You've got to be kidding me!

728
00:50:46,560 --> 00:50:48,100
Come on, get in the S8!

729
00:50:48,740 --> 00:50:49,740
Boo!

730
00:50:51,260 --> 00:50:52,280
I understand.

731
00:50:53,560 --> 00:50:54,760
This is ridiculous!

732
00:50:56,320 --> 00:50:57,320
Listen, everyone.

733
00:50:58,100 --> 00:51:01,480
One of the competitors from the next
battle has not arrived yet.

734
00:51:02,710 --> 00:51:05,875
So, we're going to postpone
this match briefly and simply

735
00:51:05,876 --> 00:51:08,381
jump ahead to the battle that
would have followed this one.

736
00:51:10,880 --> 00:51:13,740
Just what in the world could Sasuke be
doing anyway?

737
00:51:14,060 --> 00:51:14,740
So cool!

738
00:51:15,080 --> 00:51:17,320
That means Sasuke is still in this!

739
00:51:23,820 --> 00:51:24,820
That's good!

740
00:51:25,100 --> 00:51:25,660
Hey!

741
00:51:26,120 --> 00:51:28,880
That means my battle's one match closer
now!

742
00:51:28,960 --> 00:51:29,620
What a drag!

743
00:51:29,621 --> 00:51:32,180
Then on to the next battle!

744
00:51:33,220 --> 00:51:36,440
So, Shino and Kankuro, come down.

745
00:51:38,720 --> 00:51:41,980
My match doesn't matter at all now.

746
00:51:45,960 --> 00:51:49,263
Besides, I don't want to reveal
the mechanism of my trained

747
00:51:49,264 --> 00:51:53,140
crow puppet to the enemy
before our plan comes to fruition.

748
00:51:56,160 --> 00:51:56,840
Proctor!

749
00:51:56,841 --> 00:51:57,920
I withdraw!

750
00:51:57,921 --> 00:51:58,921
Huh?

751
00:51:59,200 --> 00:52:00,200
What?

752
00:52:01,040 --> 00:52:04,900
I withdraw, so please, advance to the next
match!

753
00:52:05,260 --> 00:52:05,540
Whoa!

754
00:52:05,541 --> 00:52:06,541
What is this?

755
00:52:07,640 --> 00:52:08,640
Sigh...

756
00:52:08,800 --> 00:52:13,560
Due to Kankuro's withdrawal, Shino Aburame
wins by default.

757
00:52:13,900 --> 00:52:14,440
What?

758
00:52:14,720 --> 00:52:16,760
We came here for a real match!

759
00:52:17,040 --> 00:52:17,280
Come on!

760
00:52:17,320 --> 00:52:18,320
I don't want to see this!

761
00:52:21,720 --> 00:52:22,720
Ah!

762
00:52:23,840 --> 00:52:24,840
Ah!

763
00:52:25,040 --> 00:52:25,540
Ah!

764
00:52:25,540 --> 00:52:26,540
No,

765
00:52:32,300 --> 00:52:36,260
I'd like a real match!

766
00:52:37,060 --> 00:52:37,980
Wanna go with me?

767
00:52:37,981 --> 00:52:39,200
Let's go!

768
00:52:40,660 --> 00:52:41,660
Shino!

769
00:52:41,840 --> 00:52:45,500
Oh, please, help me!

770
00:52:45,501 --> 00:52:45,820
What was that?

771
00:52:45,821 --> 00:52:47,556
After all you've done for me, you're going
to fight him?

772
00:52:47,580 --> 00:52:49,020
Yeah, I won't do that!

773
00:52:49,021 --> 00:52:50,540
You might be the one who won't fight me.

774
00:52:50,541 --> 00:52:51,541
Huh?

775
00:52:52,000 --> 00:52:56,060
I know it's hard to make a living if
you leave... Shikamaru Nara, come on!

776
00:52:56,500 --> 00:52:57,100
Great.

777
00:52:57,380 --> 00:52:59,780
If it's gonna be like this, maybe I'll
withdraw too.

778
00:53:00,460 --> 00:53:00,920
Alright!

779
00:53:01,360 --> 00:53:03,180
Go on, Shikamaru, you can do it!

780
00:53:26,730 --> 00:53:28,230
Damn that Naruto.

781
00:53:33,050 --> 00:53:34,050
They

782
00:53:41,930 --> 00:53:43,430
don't care about this match.

783
00:53:43,431 --> 00:53:45,810
Just the warm-up for the main event.

784
00:53:45,970 --> 00:53:48,490
All they care about is watching Sasuke.

785
00:53:49,070 --> 00:53:51,270
Listen to me, the jerks.

786
00:53:53,190 --> 00:53:54,250
What is it?

787
00:53:54,450 --> 00:53:56,370
You planning on giving up too?

788
00:53:56,690 --> 00:53:59,590
And to top it off, my opponent's a girl.

789
00:53:59,950 --> 00:54:00,950
Again.

790
00:54:00,990 --> 00:54:03,610
Well, he never was very driven.

791
00:54:03,770 --> 00:54:04,770
But this?

792
00:54:04,830 --> 00:54:05,890
Come on, come on!

793
00:54:06,030 --> 00:54:07,030
Get up and fight!

794
00:54:07,330 --> 00:54:09,190
Get it together, Shikamaru!

795
00:54:09,470 --> 00:54:11,650
You gonna get going sometime this year?

796
00:54:12,050 --> 00:54:14,150
Well, if you won't fight, I'll move,
I will!

797
00:54:14,430 --> 00:54:16,610
Hey, I didn't start the match yet.

798
00:54:17,030 --> 00:54:18,030
I forgot.

799
00:54:18,110 --> 00:54:19,810
This girl's a Spunky one.

800
00:54:19,990 --> 00:54:21,290
I hate Spunky.

801
00:54:37,590 --> 00:54:40,389
It really doesn't make
a whole lot of difference

802
00:54:40,390 --> 00:54:43,171
to me whether I ever
become a Chunin or not.

803
00:54:43,430 --> 00:54:47,090
But I guess maybe I shouldn't let myself
get beaten by a female.

804
00:54:48,850 --> 00:54:50,310
So, let's do it!

805
00:55:06,390 --> 00:55:08,850
He's quick enough when it comes to running
away.

806
00:55:13,970 --> 00:55:17,810
I know it's not very classy for a guy to
clobber a girl.

807
00:55:18,090 --> 00:55:20,390
But whoever said I was classy?

808
00:55:22,370 --> 00:55:25,170
He's trying to lure me into the shadow of
that tree.

809
00:55:25,490 --> 00:55:27,010
I'm not falling for that.

810
00:55:27,490 --> 00:55:30,010
So why do I always have to fight girls?

811
00:55:30,270 --> 00:55:31,510
It sucks, man.

812
00:55:32,384 --> 00:55:34,050
Go for it, Shikamaru!

813
00:55:34,690 --> 00:55:38,290
Use the super ultimate technique on her
and take that bitch down!

814
00:55:41,090 --> 00:55:42,350
Yo, is this seat taken?

815
00:55:43,350 --> 00:55:45,730
I thought you were in the hospital.

816
00:55:46,170 --> 00:55:47,390
Your stomach's okay now?

817
00:55:51,630 --> 00:55:52,290
What's up?

818
00:55:52,480 --> 00:55:54,810
I thought Sasuke's match was supposed to
be next.

819
00:55:59,530 --> 00:56:01,090
I'm sure Sasuke's fine.

820
00:56:01,430 --> 00:56:02,930
He'll be here any minute now.

821
00:56:04,450 --> 00:56:06,850
Man, you'd think her puppy died or
something.

822
00:56:09,070 --> 00:56:11,250
Never expected to see Shikamaru in the
final.

823
00:56:12,910 --> 00:56:13,390
Weird.

824
00:56:13,630 --> 00:56:14,650
What do you mean?

825
00:56:14,890 --> 00:56:15,890
Come on.

826
00:56:15,939 --> 00:56:19,010
Shikamaru may not have as much fighting
spirit as some other people.

827
00:56:19,605 --> 00:56:22,590
And okay, his technique is pretty lousy,
but he's strong at strategy.

828
00:56:23,840 --> 00:56:25,754
So strong, in fact, that
without him we might

829
00:56:25,755 --> 00:56:28,011
not have gotten through
the preliminary round.

830
00:56:29,290 --> 00:56:29,770
Huh?

831
00:56:29,771 --> 00:56:30,771
Maybe.

832
00:56:30,805 --> 00:56:33,810
What's more, you should have seen how he
threw himself into the arena.

833
00:56:34,890 --> 00:56:37,670
I'm telling you, Choji, he seems unusually
aggressive.

834
00:56:38,410 --> 00:56:40,870
I think he's gonna show us his passionate
side today!

835
00:56:40,871 --> 00:56:41,910
Yeah!

836
00:56:42,170 --> 00:56:43,650
Go, Shikamaru!

837
00:56:47,070 --> 00:56:49,250
Sometimes I wish I was a cloud.

838
00:56:49,930 --> 00:56:51,830
Just floating along...

839
00:56:52,910 --> 00:56:55,190
Going wherever the breeze takes me.

840
00:56:55,810 --> 00:56:56,910
That's my style.

841
00:56:57,630 --> 00:56:59,910
I'm just not into putting effort into
stuff.

842
00:57:00,450 --> 00:57:04,210
The only reason I became a ninja was so I
could do whatever I wanted.

843
00:57:05,730 --> 00:57:08,150
Jeez, who knew it'd be so much work?

844
00:57:09,070 --> 00:57:10,070
Hmm...

845
00:57:13,930 --> 00:57:17,030
Hmm... Hmm...
Hmm... Oh, well... Heh.

846
00:57:17,170 --> 00:57:19,650
A guy's gotta do what a guy's gotta do.

847
00:57:20,260 --> 00:57:22,370
What's he thinking behind that stupid
grin?

848
00:57:22,590 --> 00:57:23,630
Is he mocking me?

849
00:57:25,430 --> 00:57:26,110
Ninja Art!

850
00:57:26,439 --> 00:57:28,410
Wind-Side Choo-Choo!

851
00:57:28,970 --> 00:57:29,970
Yeah!

852
00:57:30,090 --> 00:57:31,090
Ha-ha-ha!

853
00:57:31,750 --> 00:57:32,750
Yeah!

854
00:57:38,260 --> 00:57:39,280
I remember.

855
00:57:39,600 --> 00:57:41,520
This is how she beat me in our fight.

856
00:57:41,680 --> 00:57:42,500
I remember.

857
00:57:42,500 --> 00:57:42,500
This is how she beat me in our fight.

858
00:57:42,501 --> 00:57:43,880
Ruin her can get past it!

859
00:57:58,600 --> 00:58:00,300
Now I get it.

860
00:58:06,380 --> 00:58:07,660
Almost got me.

861
00:58:08,200 --> 00:58:09,420
Aren't you clever?

862
00:58:10,120 --> 00:58:16,081
With that shadow possession jutsu of yours,
you can manipulate any shadow you're in.

863
00:58:16,460 --> 00:58:18,580
The wall's shadow, for instance.

864
00:58:18,780 --> 00:58:20,400
But there's a limit, isn't there?

865
00:58:20,560 --> 00:58:24,120
No matter how thin you stretch it,
it'll only reach so far.

866
00:58:24,520 --> 00:58:25,600
Isn't that right?

867
00:58:26,720 --> 00:58:27,820
You got me.

868
00:58:28,940 --> 00:58:31,560
And now I know just where that limit is.

869
00:58:31,780 --> 00:58:35,260
Even using the wall's shadow, his jutsu
can only reach to here.

870
00:58:36,400 --> 00:58:38,300
15 meters, 32 centimeters.

871
00:58:38,860 --> 00:58:40,460
That's the range of his attack.

872
00:58:40,840 --> 00:58:45,220
If I can just stay outside this line,
he can't touch me.

873
00:58:46,180 --> 00:58:47,760
She's measured his range.

874
00:58:48,200 --> 00:58:50,140
This plays right to his strength.

875
00:58:50,260 --> 00:58:52,300
She's better at long range attacks anyway.

876
00:58:52,980 --> 00:58:55,700
This match is as good as over.

877
00:59:14,270 --> 00:59:14,970
What's that?

878
00:59:15,230 --> 00:59:16,290
A hand sign?

879
00:59:17,830 --> 00:59:19,970
No, he's not making a hand sign.

880
00:59:20,290 --> 00:59:22,350
It's something more like a habit.

881
00:59:22,670 --> 00:59:23,690
A habit?

882
00:59:23,930 --> 00:59:24,970
That kid.

883
00:59:25,290 --> 00:59:26,650
He's like an old man.

884
00:59:26,710 --> 00:59:28,170
He likes to take things slowly.

885
00:59:28,171 --> 00:59:29,171
Heh.

886
00:59:29,270 --> 00:59:31,050
I mean really slowly.

887
00:59:31,690 --> 00:59:34,530
That's why he's so good at games like Go
and Shogi.

888
00:59:34,770 --> 00:59:37,010
He's always challenging me to a match.

889
00:59:41,230 --> 00:59:45,830
Whenever he gets stuck in a move,
he does that thing with his hands.

890
00:59:52,730 --> 00:59:53,850
What does it mean?

891
00:59:54,910 --> 00:59:56,610
He's working on a strategy.

892
01:00:01,800 --> 01:00:02,800
Huh?

893
01:00:05,220 --> 01:00:08,780
All the times we've played, I've never
beaten him.

894
01:00:10,020 --> 01:00:15,060
Well that's fine but... this is a
real fight, not some game of Shogi.

895
01:00:15,580 --> 01:00:18,413
Strategy on a gameboard
is no different from strategy

896
01:00:18,414 --> 01:00:21,280
on the field of battle and
all great generals know that.

897
01:00:22,180 --> 01:00:24,180
Shikamaru's got the mind of a great
general.

898
01:00:24,340 --> 01:00:25,360
Just you watch.

899
01:00:25,660 --> 01:00:26,860
You could've fooled me.

900
01:00:27,340 --> 01:00:30,580
Don't forget I saw the test scores when we
grouped the Genin.

901
01:00:30,840 --> 01:00:33,660
His were no better than Naruto's,
maybe worse.

902
01:00:34,120 --> 01:00:34,720
He's a little too strong.

903
01:00:34,720 --> 01:00:34,720
I'd say he's a bit more powerful.

904
01:00:34,740 --> 01:00:37,220
He says the act of putting pencil to paper
is a drag.

905
01:00:37,440 --> 01:00:38,640
It's too much work for him.

906
01:00:38,780 --> 01:00:41,100
He'd rather take a nap than a written
exam.

907
01:00:41,660 --> 01:00:42,660
He would, huh?

908
01:00:42,800 --> 01:00:44,440
I didn't say he wasn't lazy.

909
01:00:44,760 --> 01:00:48,240
But he was so good at strategy games I had
him take an IQ test.

910
01:00:48,800 --> 01:00:52,360
Of course I had to deceive him into
thinking it was just another game.

911
01:00:54,820 --> 01:00:58,540
As I suspected, his score was almost off
the charts.

912
01:00:58,740 --> 01:00:59,740
Beyond genius.

913
01:00:59,940 --> 01:01:02,260
The kid has an IQ of over 200.

914
01:01:03,540 --> 01:01:04,540
200?

915
01:01:04,740 --> 01:01:05,740
200?

916
01:01:06,420 --> 01:01:07,420
200?

917
01:01:15,360 --> 01:01:17,790
So you have some fighting spirit after
all.

918
01:01:25,330 --> 01:01:26,850
So you have some fighting spirit after
all.

919
01:01:26,851 --> 01:01:27,851
No use in hiding!

920
01:01:34,110 --> 01:01:37,110
Are you sure he's even got a strategy?

921
01:01:37,750 --> 01:01:40,410
Are you sure he's even got a strategy?

922
01:01:40,411 --> 01:01:40,630
Look at that.

923
01:01:40,750 --> 01:01:42,230
He can't get anywhere near her.

924
01:01:42,490 --> 01:01:43,590
Go, Shikamaru!

925
01:01:43,730 --> 01:01:44,730
Do something!

926
01:01:45,350 --> 01:01:46,530
Don't waste your breath.

927
01:01:46,710 --> 01:01:47,710
He'll give up soon.

928
01:01:48,570 --> 01:01:50,690
This is way too much work for him.

929
01:01:56,150 --> 01:01:57,410
You can't hide forever.

930
01:01:58,420 --> 01:01:59,420
Come out, coward!

931
01:02:00,770 --> 01:02:01,770
Forget

932
01:02:11,490 --> 01:02:11,730
it.

933
01:02:11,830 --> 01:02:15,290
As long as I stay on this side of the
line, he can't touch me.

934
01:02:15,670 --> 01:02:16,670
What the?

935
01:02:16,750 --> 01:02:17,830
It's still coming!

936
01:02:20,610 --> 01:02:22,090
You're pretty quick on your toes.

937
01:02:23,130 --> 01:02:24,990
Now I see what you've been up to.

938
01:02:25,210 --> 01:02:26,530
You weren't just hiding.

939
01:02:26,690 --> 01:02:27,930
You were killing time.

940
01:02:28,230 --> 01:02:29,870
Waiting for the sun to get lower.

941
01:02:30,010 --> 01:02:32,010
And the shadow of that wall to get longer.

942
01:02:33,970 --> 01:02:37,650
The longer the shadows, the farther your
range is, right?

943
01:02:49,960 --> 01:02:50,440
Alright.

944
01:02:50,441 --> 01:02:54,420
If I just calculate the height of the sun
and measuring the distance he's gained

945
01:02:54,421 --> 01:02:56,940
from his previous attack, I can still keep
out of range.

946
01:02:57,220 --> 01:02:58,220
No problem.

947
01:03:03,500 --> 01:03:04,060
Tamari!

948
01:03:04,240 --> 01:03:05,240
Over your head!

949
01:03:09,480 --> 01:03:10,600
Oh no!

950
01:03:13,660 --> 01:03:15,040
I've got you now!

951
01:03:18,320 --> 01:03:22,380
He made a parachute out of his jacket to
create an extra shadow.

952
01:03:25,700 --> 01:03:26,700
Oof!

953
01:03:36,340 --> 01:03:39,140
She learns fast, I'll give her that.

954
01:03:46,340 --> 01:03:49,460
The longer this match takes, the lower the
sun gets.

955
01:03:49,720 --> 01:03:52,860
The longer the shadows, the farther his
range.

956
01:03:53,240 --> 01:03:54,240
Eek.

957
01:03:56,760 --> 01:03:58,580
Time to finish this.

958
01:04:00,360 --> 01:04:01,360
Now!

959
01:04:03,980 --> 01:04:05,440
Clone jutsu!

960
01:04:06,300 --> 01:04:07,300
What?

961
01:04:08,780 --> 01:04:10,260
My... my body!

962
01:04:10,700 --> 01:04:11,780
It's frozen!

963
01:04:16,340 --> 01:04:20,700
It took a while, but my shadow possession
finally worked.

964
01:04:20,980 --> 01:04:21,980
No!

965
01:04:27,780 --> 01:04:29,600
How the hell did he do that?

966
01:04:30,360 --> 01:04:31,360
Amazing.

967
01:04:31,460 --> 01:04:34,020
He was thinking three moves ahead all
along.

968
01:04:34,700 --> 01:04:37,400
As I said, that's Shikamaru's strength.

969
01:04:38,000 --> 01:04:38,600
Impossible.

970
01:04:39,020 --> 01:04:41,240
How could he have caught me with his
shadow?

971
01:04:41,520 --> 01:04:43,220
It couldn't reach this far.

972
01:04:45,640 --> 01:04:46,240
Hmph.

973
01:04:46,241 --> 01:04:47,480
Look behind you.

974
01:04:47,580 --> 01:04:48,580
I'll let you.

975
01:04:57,260 --> 01:04:58,400
Out of the hole?

976
01:04:58,960 --> 01:04:59,960
How?

977
01:05:01,020 --> 01:05:02,840
Don't you recognize that hole?

978
01:05:03,680 --> 01:05:07,160
It's where Naruto popped out of the ground
and knocked Neji for a loop.

979
01:05:09,000 --> 01:05:11,800
The hole in front of you is where he went
into the ground.

980
01:05:12,300 --> 01:05:14,320
The two are connected.

981
01:05:15,400 --> 01:05:16,460
Now I see.

982
01:05:16,820 --> 01:05:18,900
I never thought of the shadows
underground.

983
01:05:20,180 --> 01:05:21,460
That was your mistake.

984
01:05:21,800 --> 01:05:24,659
The whole time I thought I
was keeping out of range of

985
01:05:24,660 --> 01:05:27,780
his shadow jutsu, when I
was really walking right into it.

986
01:05:30,300 --> 01:05:31,300
Amazing.

987
01:05:32,040 --> 01:05:34,820
This slacker clown outsmarted me.

988
01:05:35,880 --> 01:05:37,880
The next move is checkmate.

989
01:05:46,310 --> 01:05:48,190
He's got control of my body.

990
01:05:48,490 --> 01:05:49,490
I'm helpless.

991
01:05:55,550 --> 01:05:56,590
Look at everybody.

992
01:05:56,750 --> 01:05:59,010
A minute ago they were throwing things at
him.

993
01:05:59,370 --> 01:06:02,750
Well, who would have ever thought the
guy'd turn out to be a ringer?

994
01:06:03,210 --> 01:06:03,750
Yeah!

995
01:06:03,870 --> 01:06:04,870
He did it!

996
01:06:04,960 --> 01:06:05,990
He pulled off an upset!

997
01:06:05,991 --> 01:06:07,830
You got her!

998
01:06:07,970 --> 01:06:08,970
Way to go!

999
01:06:31,490 --> 01:06:33,190
The hell with it.

1000
01:06:33,440 --> 01:06:34,440
I give up.

1001
01:06:34,570 --> 01:06:35,570
Huh?

1002
01:06:35,750 --> 01:06:36,750
Huh?

1003
01:06:36,870 --> 01:06:37,510
Huh?

1004
01:06:37,750 --> 01:06:38,750
Huh?

1005
01:06:38,810 --> 01:06:39,810
Huh?

1006
01:06:43,440 --> 01:06:44,480
He what?

1007
01:06:45,160 --> 01:06:47,100
You gotta be kidding me!

1008
01:06:47,220 --> 01:06:48,220
Loser!

1009
01:06:50,380 --> 01:06:50,900
See?

1010
01:06:51,200 --> 01:06:52,500
I told you he'd give up.

1011
01:06:54,260 --> 01:06:58,140
Looks like I know Shikumaru a little bit
better than you do, huh?

1012
01:06:58,840 --> 01:06:59,360
What?

1013
01:06:59,760 --> 01:07:00,820
What did you say?

1014
01:07:03,740 --> 01:07:07,020
I used up all my chakra on that shadow
possession jutsu.

1015
01:07:07,380 --> 01:07:09,360
I'm good for about another ten seconds.

1016
01:07:09,700 --> 01:07:10,700
That's it.

1017
01:07:12,380 --> 01:07:12,980
Bummer.

1018
01:07:13,120 --> 01:07:16,640
And here I'd already planned out the next
two hundred moves in my head.

1019
01:07:16,940 --> 01:07:18,800
But my chakra's running low.

1020
01:07:22,860 --> 01:07:27,380
Anyway, if I was to win this thing,
it would just mean more work.

1021
01:07:27,800 --> 01:07:29,900
This guy is something else.

1022
01:07:30,920 --> 01:07:33,180
The winner is... Tamari!

1023
01:07:35,980 --> 01:07:36,980
Tamari!

1024
01:07:37,484 --> 01:07:38,484
Tamari!

1025
01:07:39,279 --> 01:07:39,980
Tamari!

1026
01:07:40,220 --> 01:07:41,220
Tamari!

1027
01:07:46,160 --> 01:07:46,780
Damn it!

1028
01:07:46,780 --> 01:07:46,780
Ahhhh!

1029
01:07:47,510 --> 01:07:48,510
What a waste!

1030
01:07:49,669 --> 01:07:50,440
Why!?

1031
01:07:50,640 --> 01:07:51,540
What is he thinking!?

1032
01:07:51,541 --> 01:07:53,140
Doesn't he wanna be a Cd?

1033
01:07:53,900 --> 01:07:55,000
What can you say?

1034
01:07:55,120 --> 01:07:56,120
It's Shikumaru.

1035
01:08:00,520 --> 01:08:03,480
I wonder...you think he has the motivation
for this?

1036
01:08:04,200 --> 01:08:07,880
I've wondered that same thing myself,
so many times.

1037
01:08:08,680 --> 01:08:09,680
You on.

1038
01:08:09,681 --> 01:08:14,420
Even so, his tactics and ingenuity are far
beyond those of your typical genin.

1039
01:08:15,660 --> 01:08:17,959
If that had been a real
mission and he'd been

1040
01:08:17,960 --> 01:08:20,080
leading a squad, they
would have succeeded.

1041
01:08:20,560 --> 01:08:24,240
The battle was won the moment he caught
Tamari in that shadow possession.

1042
01:08:25,859 --> 01:08:29,120
I guess you could say he won the battle
but lost the match.

1043
01:08:30,220 --> 01:08:34,979
He may not be as motivated as some of the
others, but you know it's not such a bad

1044
01:08:34,980 --> 01:08:37,920
thing for a squad leader to trust his head
more than his gut.

1045
01:08:37,921 --> 01:08:39,920
He'll get in a lot less trouble that way.

1046
01:08:40,020 --> 01:08:41,180
You said it.

1047
01:08:41,500 --> 01:08:45,920
A squad with a hotshot for a leader is a
squad that's not going to survive very long.

1048
01:08:46,399 --> 01:08:49,459
Some of these kids don't
understand there's not much point

1049
01:08:49,460 --> 01:08:52,160
in completing a mission if
your whole team gets wiped out.

1050
01:08:52,300 --> 01:08:54,319
That's not what being a Chunin is about.

1051
01:08:54,760 --> 01:08:58,439
If you're scoring them on that,
Naruto and Neji failed the test.

1052
01:08:59,260 --> 01:09:02,859
Still, I can't help feeling Shikamaru gave
up too soon.

1053
01:09:06,680 --> 01:09:07,680
What do you think?

1054
01:09:09,020 --> 01:09:10,819
Well, one thing I'm sure of.

1055
01:09:11,620 --> 01:09:14,560
He's got a lot better chance than that
Naruto kid.

1056
01:09:15,460 --> 01:09:16,880
That lazy son of a...

1057
01:09:17,979 --> 01:09:20,000
I'm gonna give him a piece of my mind!

1058
01:09:21,530 --> 01:09:23,979
And to think that lazy kid's gonna be a
Chunin.

1059
01:09:24,570 --> 01:09:26,560
Hey, I wanna talk to you, you idiot!

1060
01:09:27,080 --> 01:09:29,140
Who you calling an idiot, idiot?

1061
01:09:29,560 --> 01:09:30,479
Why'd you give up?

1062
01:09:30,500 --> 01:09:32,800
You really that lazy or you just a big
chicken?

1063
01:09:33,220 --> 01:09:34,399
Hey, it's over.

1064
01:09:34,760 --> 01:09:35,960
Let's just forget it, okay?

1065
01:09:36,580 --> 01:09:37,560
Are you kidding?

1066
01:09:37,561 --> 01:09:39,180
No, it's not okay!

1067
01:09:39,399 --> 01:09:40,420
You had that match won and you just gave
up!

1068
01:09:40,421 --> 01:09:41,421
Would you skip it?

1069
01:09:41,520 --> 01:09:42,600
Are you forgetting?

1070
01:09:42,920 --> 01:09:44,180
There's another match.

1071
01:09:44,560 --> 01:09:44,580
What kind of guy does that?

1072
01:09:44,835 --> 01:09:46,380
I mean to quit right when...

1073
01:09:46,530 --> 01:09:47,530
Huh?

1074
01:09:47,710 --> 01:09:48,710
Another match?

1075
01:09:52,399 --> 01:09:53,399
Huh?

1076
01:09:53,859 --> 01:09:55,020
Yeah, that's right!

1077
01:09:57,160 --> 01:10:00,500
I heard that Sasuke Uchiha had to pull out
of the match.

1078
01:10:00,760 --> 01:10:00,900
What?

1079
01:10:01,040 --> 01:10:01,640
No way!

1080
01:10:01,920 --> 01:10:02,920
Come on, Uchiha!

1081
01:10:03,020 --> 01:10:04,020
Let's go!

1082
01:10:04,140 --> 01:10:07,860
Well, it seems fairly clear this Uchiha is
bound to win.

1083
01:10:08,380 --> 01:10:10,060
I wouldn't be so sure.

1084
01:10:10,280 --> 01:10:12,720
I like the look of this stranger from the
Sand Village.

1085
01:10:13,020 --> 01:10:15,440
I'm putting my money on the mystery man.

1086
01:10:17,340 --> 01:10:21,720
Lord Hokage, I'm afraid there's still no
sign of Sasuke Uchiha.

1087
01:10:21,940 --> 01:10:23,560
He hasn't arrived at the arena.

1088
01:10:25,280 --> 01:10:25,800
Right.

1089
01:10:25,801 --> 01:10:27,440
Then we have no choice.

1090
01:10:28,060 --> 01:10:30,360
Surely we can give him another ten
minutes.

1091
01:10:30,960 --> 01:10:31,960
My lord?

1092
01:10:32,440 --> 01:10:34,540
This is what the crowd's been waiting for.

1093
01:10:34,541 --> 01:10:37,100
It would be a cruel blow to cancel.

1094
01:10:37,420 --> 01:10:39,280
They might even turn ugly.

1095
01:10:39,860 --> 01:10:43,800
After waiting this long, surely another
ten minutes won't hurt.

1096
01:10:44,360 --> 01:10:48,020
There's something in what Lord Kazekage
says, I must admit.

1097
01:10:48,460 --> 01:10:49,460
Go.

1098
01:10:49,520 --> 01:10:51,300
Tell Genma my decision.

1099
01:10:52,260 --> 01:10:53,260
Right.

1100
01:10:57,080 --> 01:10:58,120
I see.

1101
01:10:58,340 --> 01:11:00,400
A ten minute reprieve, huh?

1102
01:11:06,680 --> 01:11:07,680
Sasuke!

1103
01:11:13,560 --> 01:11:14,000
Huh?

1104
01:11:14,300 --> 01:11:15,800
Hey, is that who I think it is?

1105
01:11:23,780 --> 01:11:27,940
Man, I swear if he doesn't show,
I'll kill him!

1106
01:11:28,000 --> 01:11:29,160
I swear I'll kill him!

1107
01:11:29,480 --> 01:11:29,920
Welcome.

1108
01:11:30,040 --> 01:11:31,260
Glad you both could make it.

1109
01:11:31,400 --> 01:11:32,520
Yeah, what a surprise.

1110
01:11:32,740 --> 01:11:33,740
Go right on in.

1111
01:11:37,300 --> 01:11:38,300
Roger!

1112
01:11:39,100 --> 01:11:39,660
Hmm.

1113
01:11:40,060 --> 01:11:41,780
Well, Lee, ready to go?

1114
01:11:42,060 --> 01:11:43,060
Yes, sir!

1115
01:11:43,240 --> 01:11:45,120
You've missed most of the first round.

1116
01:11:45,260 --> 01:11:48,840
The only match left is between Sasuke
Uchiha and that Gaara kid.

1117
01:11:49,640 --> 01:11:52,260
But what happened with Naruto and Neji?

1118
01:11:52,760 --> 01:11:54,880
Well, that was the most amazing thing.

1119
01:11:55,140 --> 01:11:57,280
The Hyuga kid actually got beat.

1120
01:12:05,880 --> 01:12:07,600
Naruto beat Neji?

1121
01:12:12,540 --> 01:12:13,760
That is something.

1122
01:12:15,120 --> 01:12:16,320
Well done, Naruto.

1123
01:12:17,520 --> 01:12:18,520
Congratulations.

1124
01:12:19,460 --> 01:12:22,520
Lee will always be a winner where it
counts.

1125
01:12:22,800 --> 01:12:24,140
In his heart.

1126
01:12:33,580 --> 01:12:35,220
Tamari, what's going on?

1127
01:12:35,340 --> 01:12:36,100
What's up?

1128
01:12:36,240 --> 01:12:37,900
Is he really not going to show?

1129
01:12:38,620 --> 01:12:40,080
He'll be here.

1130
01:12:40,280 --> 01:12:41,280
Huh?

1131
01:12:41,680 --> 01:12:43,920
He'll definitely be here.

1132
01:13:07,550 --> 01:13:08,890
We're a little late.

1133
01:13:09,130 --> 01:13:10,650
Hope we didn't miss the party.

1134
01:13:12,970 --> 01:13:14,450
And you are?

1135
01:13:14,970 --> 01:13:17,090
I'm Sasuke Uchiha.

1136
01:13:17,750 --> 01:13:18,750
Sasuke!

1137
01:13:19,350 --> 01:13:20,070
Huh.

1138
01:13:20,230 --> 01:13:22,490
So you decided to show up after all.

1139
01:13:22,710 --> 01:13:24,890
I was betting you wouldn't come to see me.

1140
01:13:24,891 --> 01:13:26,570
Sooner or later, you'd have to face me!

1141
01:13:28,070 --> 01:13:29,830
Well, don't get too full of yourself.

1142
01:13:30,270 --> 01:13:31,430
You're still a loser.

1143
01:13:32,750 --> 01:13:34,310
Anyway, what about you, Naruto?

1144
01:13:35,190 --> 01:13:36,970
Tell me, did you win?

1145
01:13:37,390 --> 01:13:38,490
You know it!

1146
01:13:38,790 --> 01:13:40,330
Sorry if we kept you waiting.

1147
01:13:40,530 --> 01:13:42,670
But, um... how late are we?

1148
01:13:42,870 --> 01:13:47,570
I mean, it's not like Sasuke's...
well, disqualified or anything, right?

1149
01:13:47,830 --> 01:13:51,870
You know you were so late that we extended
the deadline for you.

1150
01:13:51,990 --> 01:13:53,370
No is not disqualified.

1151
01:13:54,970 --> 01:13:56,270
Oh, that's a relief.

1152
01:14:06,390 --> 01:14:07,510
Listen, Sasuke.

1153
01:14:07,810 --> 01:14:08,970
Don't lose to him.

1154
01:14:09,710 --> 01:14:10,710
Got it.

1155
01:14:16,110 --> 01:14:18,750
You are one of the ones I want to fight
the most.

1156
01:14:20,590 --> 01:14:21,590
Don't lose!

1157
01:14:22,010 --> 01:14:23,930
Because I want to fight you myself!

1158
01:14:25,310 --> 01:14:26,310
Got it.

1159
01:14:33,090 --> 01:14:33,670
You are one of the ones I want to fight
the most.

1160
01:14:33,671 --> 01:14:34,671
Is that really him?

1161
01:14:34,810 --> 01:14:38,270
A minute ago she was cheering just as loud
for Shikamaru.

1162
01:14:38,470 --> 01:14:39,930
Jeez, women are fickle.

1163
01:14:43,330 --> 01:14:45,530
So, I'm yesterday's news already.

1164
01:14:46,670 --> 01:14:48,490
Well, I can't say I blame him.

1165
01:14:49,090 --> 01:14:51,210
I'm looking forward to this one myself.

1166
01:14:53,390 --> 01:14:56,550
Sakura, what's it like to be on such an
amazing team?

1167
01:14:56,910 --> 01:14:57,550
What do you mean?

1168
01:14:57,810 --> 01:14:58,450
You know.

1169
01:14:58,451 --> 01:15:01,810
First, Naruto surprises everyone by
beating Neji Hyuga.

1170
01:15:02,210 --> 01:15:05,610
Oh, and then you've got Sasuke who's like
the superstar.

1171
01:15:05,910 --> 01:15:07,730
Everyone wants to see his match.

1172
01:15:07,810 --> 01:15:09,190
You're like the all-star team!

1173
01:15:11,590 --> 01:15:15,890
Sasuke is fighting that sand ninja,
Gaara, whom I was powerless against.

1174
01:15:16,310 --> 01:15:21,070
And Naruto won against Neji, whom I'd
always wanted to defeat.

1175
01:15:26,130 --> 01:15:31,230
And all I get to do is stand here and
watch.

1176
01:15:32,810 --> 01:15:34,150
It's so frustrating.

1177
01:15:36,190 --> 01:15:37,670
Oh, Lee.

1178
01:15:41,610 --> 01:15:43,010
At last.

1179
01:15:47,130 --> 01:15:48,710
All right, Gaara.

1180
01:15:48,830 --> 01:15:49,830
Come down here.

1181
01:15:50,290 --> 01:15:51,290
Come on, Naruto.

1182
01:15:51,610 --> 01:15:52,690
They don't need us here.

1183
01:15:53,150 --> 01:15:54,310
Oh, uh...

1184
01:15:55,530 --> 01:15:56,070
Let's go.

1185
01:15:56,430 --> 01:15:59,410
And I'm gonna take the stairs this time,
if you don't mind.

1186
01:15:59,890 --> 01:16:00,690
Come on.

1187
01:16:00,710 --> 01:16:03,010
Are you still upset that I gave you a
little push?

1188
01:16:03,130 --> 01:16:04,270
You ought to be grateful.

1189
01:16:11,510 --> 01:16:12,650
This isn't good.

1190
01:16:13,530 --> 01:16:15,050
He's got that look again.

1191
01:16:16,150 --> 01:16:16,630
Okay.

1192
01:16:16,770 --> 01:16:17,890
Listen, Gaara.

1193
01:16:17,891 --> 01:16:20,050
Don't let him throw off the plan.

1194
01:16:28,280 --> 01:16:30,080
Now's not the time to talk to him.

1195
01:16:30,500 --> 01:16:32,720
Not unless you want to get yourself
killed.

1196
01:16:40,550 --> 01:16:41,550
Hey, let's go.

1197
01:16:44,605 --> 01:16:45,420
Will you hurry up?

1198
01:16:45,460 --> 01:16:46,000
Come on!

1199
01:16:46,400 --> 01:16:47,400
Relax, Naruto.

1200
01:16:48,130 --> 01:16:49,740
You're gonna give yourself an ulcer.

1201
01:16:49,980 --> 01:16:50,980
Huh?

1202
01:16:51,700 --> 01:16:52,700
What is it?

1203
01:16:54,460 --> 01:16:55,460
Huh?

1204
01:17:02,740 --> 01:17:05,640
You puny kids think this tournament is
about you.

1205
01:17:05,760 --> 01:17:08,020
But it's really about the people who bet
on you.

1206
01:17:08,080 --> 01:17:09,860
Or against you, in your case.

1207
01:17:10,655 --> 01:17:13,960
You see, our master's got a lot of money
on the other guy to win.

1208
01:17:14,460 --> 01:17:15,460
Got it.

1209
01:17:16,070 --> 01:17:17,920
That means... you gotta lose.

1210
01:17:22,660 --> 01:17:23,660
No!

1211
01:17:25,000 --> 01:17:26,000
No!

1212
01:17:26,160 --> 01:17:26,680
No!

1213
01:17:26,920 --> 01:17:27,920
No!

1214
01:17:28,040 --> 01:17:28,480
No!

1215
01:17:28,480 --> 01:17:29,480
I'm

1216
01:18:30,390 --> 01:18:38,390
sorry, but we do have to finish this!

1217
01:18:38,750 --> 01:18:39,230
What a shame.

1218
01:18:39,231 --> 01:18:39,330
Now we'll have to choose our fate.

1219
01:18:39,350 --> 01:18:39,630
But not at all.

1220
01:18:39,631 --> 01:18:39,710
We can't let this go.

1221
01:18:39,730 --> 01:18:42,350
We can't let them get away with it.

1222
01:18:44,130 --> 01:18:44,610
They're no match for us.

1223
01:18:44,611 --> 01:18:45,611
I'm totally sorry.

1224
01:18:48,130 --> 01:18:49,690
Hopefully we'll have a chance to get our
revenge.

1225
01:18:49,691 --> 01:18:49,950
But I think you're in your best place
right now.

1226
01:18:49,951 --> 01:18:50,690
Even so, don't let them get away with
this.

1227
01:18:50,691 --> 01:18:51,290
I'm sure you're going to get a little more
help from your team.

1228
01:18:51,291 --> 01:18:51,650
I've realized your purpose in time,
and it's true.

1229
01:18:51,651 --> 01:18:53,210
That could have been us just now.

1230
01:18:53,910 --> 01:18:58,390
I've never in my life seen anyone kill
like that without even batting an eye.

1231
01:18:58,770 --> 01:19:01,150
Things don't look so good for your friend
at all.

1232
01:19:03,190 --> 01:19:04,190
Sasuke!

1233
01:19:13,970 --> 01:19:14,970
Alright.

1234
01:19:15,090 --> 01:19:18,870
The rules for this match are the same as
in the preliminaries.

1235
01:19:18,871 --> 01:19:23,090
The match continues until one of you dies
or admits defeat.

1236
01:19:24,170 --> 01:19:26,850
However, I can stop the match.

1237
01:19:27,070 --> 01:19:29,130
But that's solely my decision.

1238
01:19:43,200 --> 01:19:44,200
Hello, guy.

1239
01:19:44,975 --> 01:19:46,030
How are you feeling, Lee?

1240
01:19:46,360 --> 01:19:47,360
Are you alright?

1241
01:19:49,155 --> 01:19:50,155
Kakashi.

1242
01:19:50,515 --> 01:19:51,515
Kakashi-sensei!

1243
01:19:54,160 --> 01:19:55,160
Oh, right.

1244
01:19:55,690 --> 01:19:56,990
Sorry about that.

1245
01:19:57,090 --> 01:19:58,490
You must have been worried.

1246
01:19:59,470 --> 01:20:01,150
Sorry for not keeping in touch.

1247
01:20:02,070 --> 01:20:03,090
Uh-oh.

1248
01:20:03,350 --> 01:20:05,050
Sakura's gonna get really mad!

1249
01:20:09,440 --> 01:20:10,440
I don't mind.

1250
01:20:10,660 --> 01:20:11,660
That's okay.

1251
01:20:14,555 --> 01:20:15,600
Listen, sensei.

1252
01:20:15,700 --> 01:20:16,700
Hmm?

1253
01:20:18,495 --> 01:20:21,080
You know that there was a mark on Sasuke's
neck, right?

1254
01:20:25,130 --> 01:20:26,400
It's nothing to worry about.

1255
01:20:28,930 --> 01:20:30,420
So, that's that.

1256
01:20:36,370 --> 01:20:37,390
Eight of them.

1257
01:20:38,410 --> 01:20:41,770
Eight members of the Anbu Black Ops in an
arena this size?

1258
01:20:41,910 --> 01:20:43,470
That's nowhere near enough.

1259
01:20:44,385 --> 01:20:46,830
What could Lord Hokage be thinking?

1260
01:20:46,831 --> 01:20:53,570
Well, not knowing how the enemy is going
to act, the Anbu Black Ops have probably

1261
01:20:53,571 --> 01:20:56,730
been dispersed and stationed around the
key parts of the village.

1262
01:20:57,130 --> 01:20:58,130
Huh?

1263
01:20:58,370 --> 01:20:59,370
It's starting.

1264
01:21:00,090 --> 01:21:02,270
We can't afford to let our guard down.

1265
01:21:02,590 --> 01:21:06,410
But for now, at least, we need to watch
this match.

1266
01:21:06,930 --> 01:21:07,270
Haha!

1267
01:21:07,330 --> 01:21:08,330
This is gonna be awesome!

1268
01:21:10,390 --> 01:21:13,054
Kakashi, I'm gonna be
carefully watching your

1269
01:21:13,055 --> 01:21:15,590
pupil to see if your
training was any good.

1270
01:21:15,591 --> 01:21:18,690
After all, I'm still your rival.

1271
01:21:21,490 --> 01:21:22,130
Hm?

1272
01:21:22,131 --> 01:21:23,470
Sorry, did you say something?

1273
01:21:43,490 --> 01:21:44,490
Begin!

1274
01:21:51,240 --> 01:21:53,960
So this is the sand Kakashi talked about.

1275
01:22:00,280 --> 01:22:01,280
Please!

1276
01:22:02,080 --> 01:22:03,140
I beg you!

1277
01:22:03,320 --> 01:22:05,320
Don't get so mad at me!

1278
01:22:08,320 --> 01:22:09,320
Mother...

1279
01:22:10,180 --> 01:22:12,860
What in the world is he talking about?

1280
01:22:15,260 --> 01:22:16,580
Early, Arai.

1281
01:22:16,920 --> 01:22:21,120
I know I made you taste such awful blood.

1282
01:22:22,020 --> 01:22:23,640
I'm so sorry.

1283
01:22:24,660 --> 01:22:31,860
But this time, I'm sure that it'll taste
so very good.

1284
01:22:38,300 --> 01:22:39,400
He's gone.

1285
01:22:39,401 --> 01:22:41,600
Thank goodness, he's finally calmed down.

1286
01:22:41,780 --> 01:22:42,780
...

1287
01:22:43,470 --> 01:22:45,750
Then, if it's supposed to be, then I
should be the doctor.

1288
01:22:48,610 --> 01:22:51,601
Come on... ... ...

1289
01:22:52,740 --> 01:22:55,980
... ...

1290
01:23:00,230 --> 01:23:01,230
...

1291
01:23:27,540 --> 01:23:36,560
A little pause.

1292
01:23:40,520 --> 01:23:40,000
..

1293
01:23:40,000 --> 01:23:40,000
and we are back.

1294
01:23:40,020 --> 01:23:43,800
Oh, he's almost as fast as Lee's normal
speed.

1295
01:23:44,740 --> 01:23:48,100
It is almost like a mirror image of my own
taijutsu.

1296
01:23:53,420 --> 01:23:55,640
So that's your sand armor, huh?

1297
01:23:59,580 --> 01:24:00,580
Come on.

1298
01:24:01,500 --> 01:24:04,200
If you won't do it, then I will!

1299
01:24:04,420 --> 01:24:11,870
Come on.

1300
01:24:16,050 --> 01:24:17,630
What's the matter, Gaara?

1301
01:24:17,810 --> 01:24:19,210
Is that all you've got?

1302
01:24:26,060 --> 01:24:27,060
Amazing!

1303
01:24:31,380 --> 01:24:34,300
I'm going to tear off all your armor!

1304
01:24:42,040 --> 01:24:45,920
His speed's basically the same as Lee's
with his wigs removed.

1305
01:25:05,690 --> 01:25:07,780
His training... What did you two do?

1306
01:25:08,100 --> 01:25:09,100
Huh?

1307
01:25:09,655 --> 01:25:12,320
To get to such a level... in a mere month!

1308
01:25:13,700 --> 01:25:16,740
Sasuke has copied Lee's taijutsu with his
Sharingan.

1309
01:25:17,840 --> 01:25:18,520
So during this time...

1310
01:25:18,521 --> 01:25:23,528
In the Taijutsu training I did with Sasuke,
I simply had him imagine Lee's movement.

1311
01:25:23,529 --> 01:25:23,640
..

1312
01:25:23,641 --> 01:25:24,900
and copy it.

1313
01:25:26,620 --> 01:25:30,040
Sasuke mastered that Taijutsu only because
he knew Lee.

1314
01:25:30,940 --> 01:25:35,240
Of course, Sasuke had to work very hard to
master it, even with his Sharingan.

1315
01:25:36,130 --> 01:25:39,228
If Kakashi saw the battle
between Gaara and Lee,

1316
01:25:39,229 --> 01:25:42,560
why did he have Sasuke
master only Taijutsu?

1317
01:26:00,810 --> 01:26:03,390
What then was left for me in this
existence?

1318
01:26:03,470 --> 01:26:04,550
Why go on living?

1319
01:26:07,250 --> 01:26:09,770
But in order to live you need a purpose.

1320
01:26:10,070 --> 01:26:13,950
To exist for no reason is the same as
being dead.

1321
01:26:14,210 --> 01:26:16,550
What is this guy talking about?

1322
01:26:21,020 --> 01:26:23,360
Then in time the answer came to me.

1323
01:26:23,820 --> 01:26:27,860
To put it simply, my reason for living is
in the killing of others.

1324
01:26:28,340 --> 01:26:31,880
For years I lived in fear of those who
were sent to murder me.

1325
01:26:32,200 --> 01:26:33,820
But now I am at peace.

1326
01:26:38,080 --> 01:26:41,760
Shigemaru, we have to go talk to
Kakashi-sensei right now!

1327
01:26:42,345 --> 01:26:44,200
What are you planning to do?

1328
01:26:44,940 --> 01:26:45,940
Hey, wait!

1329
01:26:47,305 --> 01:26:48,820
I've gotta stop him!

1330
01:26:49,000 --> 01:26:50,660
I've gotta stop the match!

1331
01:27:26,580 --> 01:27:27,340
You just lost him for in vain.

1332
01:27:27,341 --> 01:27:29,620
So he's used all the sand as a shield.

1333
01:27:30,300 --> 01:27:35,501
Because of the sand's density, I didn't
think he could create something this hard.

1334
01:27:39,920 --> 01:27:42,280
So he's absolutely protected.

1335
01:27:44,780 --> 01:27:46,080
Kakashi-sensei!

1336
01:27:50,560 --> 01:27:51,040
Hey!

1337
01:27:51,041 --> 01:27:52,041
Naruto!

1338
01:27:55,800 --> 01:27:57,240
What is it, Naruto?

1339
01:27:58,060 --> 01:27:59,060
Sensei, please!

1340
01:27:59,160 --> 01:28:01,280
You just have to stop this match right
away!

1341
01:28:01,760 --> 01:28:02,760
What?

1342
01:28:04,180 --> 01:28:07,720
The guy Sasuke is fighting is completely
different than the rest of us!

1343
01:28:08,100 --> 01:28:10,420
He's about as far from normal as you can
get!

1344
01:28:12,000 --> 01:28:13,320
Naruto, slow down!

1345
01:28:13,560 --> 01:28:14,920
What are you trying to say?

1346
01:28:16,080 --> 01:28:18,380
He thinks his point in life is to kill
people!

1347
01:28:18,760 --> 01:28:19,760
Don't you see?

1348
01:28:19,940 --> 01:28:22,780
If this continues, Sasuke will die!

1349
01:28:25,600 --> 01:28:26,600
Relax.

1350
01:28:27,010 --> 01:28:28,100
No need to panic.

1351
01:28:28,580 --> 01:28:29,580
Huh?

1352
01:28:29,720 --> 01:28:32,540
You know, Sasuke and I weren't just
goofing around.

1353
01:28:33,410 --> 01:28:35,920
There's a reason we were so late getting
here.

1354
01:28:36,920 --> 01:28:39,160
I don't know what the hell you're up to.

1355
01:28:39,480 --> 01:28:41,260
You gonna stay in there forever?

1356
01:28:42,580 --> 01:28:44,260
Well, that's fine with me.

1357
01:28:44,420 --> 01:28:45,800
Stall all you want.

1358
01:28:46,080 --> 01:28:50,400
I can use the time getting ready for what
I've got in store for you.

1359
01:28:53,495 --> 01:28:54,495
Sensei?

1360
01:28:56,460 --> 01:28:58,300
You said there was a good reason you were
late.

1361
01:28:58,900 --> 01:28:59,900
What were you doing?

1362
01:29:00,450 --> 01:29:03,200
Well, it's kind of a long story.

1363
01:29:03,580 --> 01:29:04,300
Oh, come on!

1364
01:29:04,301 --> 01:29:05,461
Will you please do something?

1365
01:29:05,500 --> 01:29:06,760
This is no time for talking!

1366
01:29:07,020 --> 01:29:08,880
You're right, so shut up and watch.

1367
01:29:08,881 --> 01:29:09,881
Huh?

1368
01:29:10,220 --> 01:29:11,220
Huh?

1369
01:29:11,460 --> 01:29:12,460
Huh?

1370
01:29:13,700 --> 01:29:15,760
