1381
01:29:55,930 --> 01:29:56,930
Hm?

1382
01:29:57,290 --> 01:29:59,190
And I'll give it all to you.

1383
01:30:00,910 --> 01:30:03,270
I'm such a good boy, aren't I?

1384
01:30:03,970 --> 01:30:05,670
Are you watching, Mother?

1385
01:30:06,270 --> 01:30:07,310
Are you ready?

1386
01:30:08,270 --> 01:30:09,270
I'm ready.

1387
01:30:12,180 --> 01:30:13,710
What's that lunatic think he's doing?

1388
01:30:14,400 --> 01:30:16,080
How long is he going to stay in that
thing?

1389
01:30:17,120 --> 01:30:19,890
I don't know, but... he's not following
the plan.

1390
01:30:20,740 --> 01:30:22,210
He's no good to us like that.

1391
01:30:22,590 --> 01:30:23,630
It'll never work.

1392
01:30:23,790 --> 01:30:27,250
I say it's time to cut our losses and get
out of here!

1393
01:30:31,990 --> 01:30:32,990
Plan?

1394
01:30:39,190 --> 01:30:40,190
Hm?

1395
01:30:40,270 --> 01:30:41,830
But... it can't be.

1396
01:30:42,850 --> 01:30:48,810
If you wondered why I always insisted on
training Sasuke myself, now you know.

1397
01:30:50,010 --> 01:30:51,990
It's because he's like me.

1398
01:31:06,720 --> 01:31:08,400
A physical activation!

1399
01:31:10,060 --> 01:31:11,120
I see.

1400
01:31:11,460 --> 01:31:13,560
That's what you were doing all this time.

1401
01:31:13,820 --> 01:31:16,460
You were building his speed up to the
level required.

1402
01:31:17,760 --> 01:31:18,760
Exactly.

1403
01:31:24,120 --> 01:31:25,120
It's amazing!

1404
01:31:25,660 --> 01:31:27,540
His chakra is actually visible!

1405
01:31:27,960 --> 01:31:29,720
How is that even possible?

1406
01:31:30,300 --> 01:31:33,160
He's really mastered that technique
already?

1407
01:31:34,180 --> 01:31:37,800
So... this is what the Uchiha are capable
of.

1408
01:31:38,200 --> 01:31:39,200
Whoa!

1409
01:31:47,360 --> 01:31:49,360
I've never seen him do that before!

1410
01:31:49,920 --> 01:31:53,220
That bizarre noise... what sort of
technique is it?

1411
01:31:53,480 --> 01:31:54,400
It's a jab.

1412
01:31:54,401 --> 01:31:55,960
A what?

1413
01:31:57,220 --> 01:32:00,420
But this jab... is a jab like no other.

1414
01:32:00,580 --> 01:32:04,740
It's the only weapon in Kakashi's arsenal
he didn't copy from someone else.

1415
01:32:06,220 --> 01:32:09,140
It's the weapon of choice for
assassinations.

1416
01:32:10,260 --> 01:32:15,280
The secret of the jab is in the speed with
which it is delivered, and the ninja's

1417
01:32:15,281 --> 01:32:17,900
ability to focus its chakra at the point
of impact.

1418
01:32:18,340 --> 01:32:23,020
Once these two elements, speed and focus,
have attained a certain level,

1419
01:32:23,180 --> 01:32:24,380
Once these two elements, speed and focus,
have attained a certain level,

1420
01:32:24,381 --> 01:32:28,460
it only becomes visible, and gives off
that distinctive sound that you hear,

1421
01:32:28,680 --> 01:32:30,540
like birds chirping.

1422
01:32:32,460 --> 01:32:35,860
It is this sound that gives the technique
its name.

1423
01:32:39,560 --> 01:32:40,560
Chidori!

1424
01:32:56,840 --> 01:32:57,840
