Cutting lightning in half!

1435
01:33:27,500 --> 01:33:28,500
Yeah, right.

1436
01:33:28,860 --> 01:33:31,180
These old guys and their war stories.

1437
01:33:32,060 --> 01:33:32,780
Whoa!

1438
01:33:32,781 --> 01:33:39,140
But whether called Thousand Birds or
Lightning Blade, it's a technique of

1439
01:33:39,141 --> 01:33:44,400
